#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມື Public Cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you the fastest way to get {productname} up and running in "
"a public cloud environment using on-demand, {payglongform} ({payg}), or "
"{byoslongform} ({byos}) services.  {productname} Proxy in a public cloud is "
"only supported using {byos} services."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄລາວສາທາລະນະ ໂດຍໃຊ້ບໍລິການແບບຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ (On-demand), {payglongform} ({payg}), ຫຼື {byoslongform} ({byos}). ທັງນີ້ {productname} Proxy ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະແມ່ນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການໃຊ້ບໍລິການແບບ {byos} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#.  Is this statement correct regarding PAYG?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Additionally, it assumes that you are installing the {productname} Server on "
"a single cloud instance.  These procedures have been tested on "
"{awslongform}, {azure}, and {gcplongform}."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ມັນສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ໃນ cloud instance ດຽວ. ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບໃນ {awslongform}, {azure}, ແລະ {gcplongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{payglongform} or {byoslongform} services currently work on both "
"{awslongform} and {azure}."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {payglongform} ຫຼື {byoslongform} ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນ {awslongform} ແລະ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information on using {productname}, see the official {productname} "
"documentation at https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານທາງການຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/suma."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Support"
msgstr "ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Public Cloud"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "{byos} and {payg} Support"
msgstr "ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ {byos} ແລະ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Regardless of the public cloud service you use or the plan you choose, "
"{suse} has you covered with support.  Where you get support is dependent on "
"whether you **{byoslongform}** ({byos}) or you use {suse} products "
"**on-demand** **{payglongform}** ({payg})."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ບໍລິການຄລາວສາທາລະນະໃດ ຫຼື ເລືອກແພັກເກັດໃດ, {suse} ກໍມີການສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ທ່ານ. ຊ່ອງທາງການຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ແບບ **{byoslongform}** ({byos}) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງ {suse} ແບບ **ຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ (on-demand)** **{payglongform}** ({payg})."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{byos}:: {byos} instances are supported by {suse} under the terms of your "
"{suse} subscription.  For an overview of {suse}'s support subscriptions, "
"refer to https://www.suse.com/support/."
msgstr "{byos}:: ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ໄດ້ຮັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ {suse} ພາຍໃຕ້ເງື່ອນໄຂການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບພາບລວມຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ {suse}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.suse.com/support/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{payg}:: {productname} {payg} instances include support by SUSE.  To open a "
"ticket for {payg}, see https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport."
msgstr "{payg}:: ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ລວມມີການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ SUSE. ເພື່ອເປີດຕິກເກັດ (ticket) ສຳລັບ {payg}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on cloud products and support, see "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/public-cloud.html[SUSE "
"Public Cloud Guide]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ cloud ແລະ ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/public-cloud.html[SUSE Public Cloud Guide]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT)"
msgstr "Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT) provides information about the "
"images {suse} publishes and servers that are part of the {suse} operated "
"update infrastructure.  PINT is available at "
"link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com] and provided as an API and "
"command-line tool with the [literal]``python3-susepubliccloudinfo`` package "
"from the Public Cloud Module repository."
msgstr "Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT) ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອິມເມຈທີ່ {suse} ເຜີຍແຜ່ ແລະ ເຊີເວີທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດທີ່ດຳເນີນການໂດຍ {suse}. PINT ສາມາດເຂົ້າເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com] ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບ API ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມື command-line ຜ່ານແພັກເກັດ [literal]``python3-susepubliccloudinfo`` ຈາກ Public Cloud Module repository."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collecting System Information with `supportconfig`"
msgstr "ການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບດ້ວຍ `supportconfig`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To create a TAR archive with detailed system information that you can hand "
"over to Global Technical Support, use the command `supportconfig`.  The "
"command-line tool is provided by the package `supportutils` which is "
"installed by default."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ TAR archive ທີ່ລວມຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບຢ່າງລະອຽດ ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ Global Technical Support, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `supportconfig`. ເຄື່ອງມື command-line ນີ້ມີໃຫ້ຜ່ານແພັກເກັດ `supportutils` ເຊິ່ງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Depending on which packages are installed on your system, some of these "
"packages integrate `supportconfig` plug-ins.  When `supportconfig` is "
"executed, all plug-ins are executed as well, creating one or more result "
"files for the archive.  This has the benefit that the only topics checked "
"are those that contain a specific plug-in for them.  `supportconfig` "
"plug-ins are stored in directory [path]``/usr/lib/supportconfig/plugins/``."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າແພັກເກັດໃດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ, ບາງແພັກເກັດຈະມີ plug-ins ຂອງ `supportconfig` ຝັງມາຢູ່ນຳ. ເມື່ອ `supportconfig` ຖືກເຮັດວຽກ, ທຸກ plug-ins ຈະຖືກເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດໄຟລ໌ຜົນລັອກໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບ archive. ນີ້ມີຂໍ້ດີຄືຈະມີການກວດສອບສະເພາະຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ມີ plug-in ສະເພາະເທົ່ານັ້ນ. Plug-ins ຂອງ `supportconfig` ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/lib/supportconfig/plugins/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The following procedure shows how to create a `supportconfig` archive, but "
"without submitting it to support directly."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີສ້າງ archive ຂອງ `supportconfig`, ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ສົ່ງໃຫ້ທີມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a [literal]``supportconfig`` Archive"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ archive [literal]``supportconfig``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Run [literal]``supportconfig`` as root.  Usually, it is enough to run this "
"tool without any options.  Some options are very common and are displayed in "
"the following list:"
msgstr "ຣັນ [literal]``supportconfig`` ໃນຖານະ root. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ພຽງແຕ່ຣັນເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກ (options) ໃດໆກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ. ຕົວເລືອກບາງຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "-E MAIL, -N NAME, -O COMPANY, -P PHONE\n"
msgstr "-E MAIL, -N NAME, -O COMPANY, -P PHONE\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sets your contact data: e-mail address (-E)\n"
"Company name (-O)\n"
"Your name (-N)\n"
"Your phone number (-P)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງທ່ານ: ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລ (-E)\n"
"ຊື່ບໍລິສັດ (-O)\n"
"ຊື່ຂອງທ່ານ (-N)\n"
"ເບີໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານ (-P)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"-i KEYWORDS, -F\n"
"Limits the features to check. \n"
"The placeholder KEYWORDS is a comma-separated list of case-sensitive "
"keywords. \n"
"Get a list of all keywords with supportconfig -F.\n"
msgstr ""
"-i KEYWORDS, -F\n"
"ຈຳກັດຟີເຈີທີ່ຈະກວດສອບ. \n"
"KEYWORDS ຄືລາຍຊື່ຄຳສຳຄັນທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ (case-sensitive). \n"
"ເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຄຳສຳຄັນທັງໝົດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ supportconfig -F.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:20
msgid "Wait for the tool to complete the operation."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຮັດວຽກຈົນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The default archive location is `/var/log`, with the file name format being "
"**scc_HOST_DATE_TIME.txz**"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ archive ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄື `/var/log`, ໂດຍມີຮູບແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄື **scc_HOST_DATE_TIME.txz**"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Opening a New Support Case"
msgstr "ການເປີດເຄສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:23
msgid ""
"To open a new support case for your cloud {payglongform} instance, you need "
"to generate a **supportconfig** file and then follow the steps listed on:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດເຄສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃໝ່ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ cloud {payglongform} ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ **supportconfig** ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:24
msgid "link:https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport[{scclongform} Cloudsupport]"
msgstr "link:https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport[ການສະໜັບສະໜູນຄລາວຂອງ {scclongform}]"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing Services and Troubleshooting"
msgstr "ບໍລິການຄິດບິນ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "billing-data-service"
msgstr "billing-data-service"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This service serves billing data from {productname} for the "
"**CSP-billing-adapter**.  The service is reachable at:"
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຄິດບິນຈາກ {productname} ໃຫ້ກັບ **CSP-billing-adapter**. ບໍລິການນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:28
msgid "http://localhost:18888/"
msgstr "http://localhost:18888/"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:29
msgid "http://localhost:18888/metering"
msgstr "http://localhost:18888/metering"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This service is maintained by the {productname} team.  This service only "
"logs to **systemd journal**."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂດຍທີມງານ {productname}. ບໍລິການນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກ log ໄວ້ໃນ **systemd journal** ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Billing services** must be running or **spacewalk** will refuse to "
"start.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍລິການຄິດບິນ (Billing services)** ຕ້ອງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ **spacewalk** ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "csp-billing-adapter-service"
msgstr "csp-billing-adapter-service"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:33
msgid ""
"This service reports the billing data to the cloud provider (AWS, AZURE, "
"GCP).  These logs are stored in:"
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ລາຍງານຂໍ້ມູນການຄິດບິນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud (AWS, AZURE, GCP). log ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:34
msgid "`/var/log/csp_billing_adapter.log`"
msgstr "`/var/log/csp_billing_adapter.log`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:35
msgid "Additional status information can be located in:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະເພີ່ມເຕີມສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:36
msgid "`/var/lib/csp-billing-adapter/csp-config.json`"
msgstr "`/var/lib/csp-billing-adapter/csp-config.json`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:37
msgid "This service is maintained by public cloud team."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂດຍທີມງານ public cloud."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-check-payg.service"
msgstr "mgr-check-payg.service"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:39
msgid ""
"This service checks if **billing-data-service** is installed and running.  "
"It also checks if the **csp-billing-adapter-service** is installed and "
"running.  If these services are not running or installed it will attempt to "
"install and start the service."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກວດສອບວ່າ **billing-data-service** ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງກວດສອບ **csp-billing-adapter-service** ດ້ວຍ. ຫາກບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມບໍລິການໃຫ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:40
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr "ຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:41
msgid ""
"  If one of the previous billing services is not running and cannot be "
"installed or started **spacewalk** will refuse to start."
msgstr "  ຫາກບໍລິການຄິດບິນໃດໜຶ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້, **spacewalk** ຈະບໍ່ຍອມໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:42
msgid "Check `journalctl -u mgr-check-payg.service` for additional issues."
