"From the AWS Management Console dashboard, locate the menu:Services[] "
"dropdown."
msgstr "ຈາກ dashboard ຂອງ AWS Management Console, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາເມນູເລືອກ menu:Services[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
msgid "From the menu select menu:EC2[] under the **Compute** section."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:EC2[] ພາຍໃຕ້ສ່ວນ **Compute**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the EC2 dashboard, in the main content section, you'll find the "
"btn:[Launch Instance] button. Click it."
msgstr "ໃນ EC2 dashboard, ຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກ, ທ່ານຈະພົບປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch Instance]. ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"From the **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)** page.  Select **Browse "
"more AMIs**."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)**, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Browse more AMIs**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid "Search for **{productname}**."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ **{productname}**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid "Depending on your location select your AMI image."
msgstr "ເລືອກອິມເມຈ AMI ຂອງທ່ານ ຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} Server Family (EU and UK only)**\n"
msgstr "**{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະ EU ແລະ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} Server Family (non-EU and non-UK-only)**.\n"
msgstr "**{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະນອກ EU ແລະ ນອກ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Select]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Select]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:16
msgid "Proceed for image configuration."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິມເມຈຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:1
