"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Within the Managed Resource group you have set up, you will find the virtual "
"machine. To get the details, click on the name of the virtual machine.  Here "
"you can see the (public) IP address which you need to connect to the running "
"instance. SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ Managed Resource group ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ. ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP (ສາທາລະນະ) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ເຂົ້າຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {azure} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system ."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#.  (Azure requirement, not ours).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Remember, the {productname} {payg} setup requires, that a new Virtual "
"Network and a new subnet is configured, which was performed in the previous "
"step."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມວ່າ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {payg} ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ Virtual Network ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຊັບເນັດ (Subnet) ໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ດຳເນີນການແລ້ວໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Because {productname} {payg} is deployed as a 'Managed Application' it is "
"not possible to deploy into an existing network."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} {payg} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບແບບ 'Managed Application', ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before moving on to the next step, ensure the network is correctly "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When you setup new clients which should be managed, take care that you put "
"them into the private subnet which is configured with {productname} {payg} "
"or peer your networks."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ນຳພວກມັນໄປໄວ້ໃນຊັບເນັດສ່ວນຕົວ (Private subnet) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ກັບ {productname} {payg} ຫຼື ເຮັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering) ເຂົ້າຫາກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you want to manage systems in an already existing network, you must "
"configure **peering**."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ **peering**."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[Azure "
"documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[ເອກະສານຂອງ Azure]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Network Configuration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure the network configuration aligns such that `hostname -f` yields the "
"identical name as the reverse DNS lookup of the private IP address. For "
"instance, when executing `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ `hostname -f` ສະແດງຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ ການເຮັດ reverse DNS lookup ຂອງ private IP address. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອດຳເນີນການ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Insert the private IP with its Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) into "
"`/etc/hosts`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສ່ວນຕົວ ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ FQDN ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/hosts`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "`10.0.0.4   _instancename.location_.internal.cloudapp.azure.com`\n"
msgstr "`10.0.0.4   _instancename.location_.internal.cloudapp.azure.com`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Edit `/etc/sysconfig/network/config` and append "
"`internal.cloudapp.azure.com` to `NETCONFIG_DNS_STATIC_SEARCHLIST`."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ `/etc/sysconfig/network/config` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ `internal.cloudapp.azure.com` ເຂົ້າໃນ `NETCONFIG_DNS_STATIC_SEARCHLIST`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:20
msgid "Execute `netconfig update`."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການ `netconfig update`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Subsequently, `hostname -f` should return the same FQDN as obtained from "
"`nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, `hostname -f` ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ FQDN ອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When adding new virtual machines (VMs), such as {sles}, it's crucial to "
"ensure that they are configured within the same subnet as the {productname} "
"instance, or that you have setup network peering.  This step is essential "
"for successful network setup and integration."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VM) ໃໝ່ ເຊັ່ນ {sles}, ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊັບເນັດດຽວກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}, ຫຼື ທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering) ແລ້ວ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຄືອຂ່າຍປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Additionally, be mindful of the geographical restrictions associated with "
"your plans.  Make sure to utilize the appropriate Azure accounts which "
"correspond to the specific geographic zones of your project."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລະວັງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງພູມສາດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຜນການຂອງທ່ານ. ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ບັນຊີ Azure ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບເຂດພູມສາດສະເພາະຂອງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Storage"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Storage"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:26
msgid "SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານ {azure} instance ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:27
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:30
msgid "Configure storage using the appropriate tool:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid "For a standard setup, use [command]``mgr-storage-server``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບມາດຕະຖານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid "For a proxy configuration, use [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບ Proxy, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:33
msgid "For more details, run:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-storage-server --help\n"
"mgr-storage-proxy --help\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-storage-server --help\n"
"mgr-storage-proxy --help\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:35
msgid "These tools simplify the creation of container storage and database volumes."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:36
msgid "Identify the block devices:"
msgstr "ລະບຸອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (Block devices):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/\n"
msgstr "ls /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:38
msgid "This command lists the disks created during deployment. Typically:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:39
msgid "`lun3` is the storage disk."
msgstr "`lun3` ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:40
msgid "`lun4` is the database disk."
msgstr "`lun4` ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:41
msgid "Configure storage using the identified devices:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun3 /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun4\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun3 /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun4\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:43
msgid "This command creates persistent storage volumes at:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:44
msgid "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"For more details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Deploy using `mgradm` as root:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ `mgradm` ໃນຖານະ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {payg} {webui} Setup "
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} {payg} "

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} must be setup and running on {azure}.  For more information on "
"finding and setting up {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc[Azure "
"Public Cloud Images]."
msgstr "{productname} ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ {azure}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຊອກຫາ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc[Azure Public Cloud Images]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instance-flavor-check Tool and {payg} Schedule Check "
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື instance-flavor-check ແລະ ການກວດສອບຕາມກຳນົດເວລາຂອງ {payg} "

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "update-payg-default schedule task"
msgstr "ງານຕາມກຳນົດເວລາ update-payg-default"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the {payg} credentials and product list"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ {payg} ແລະ ລາຍການຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verify credentials for {payg} and refreshing the product list"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບ {payg} ແລະ ການໂຫຼດລາຍການຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On your new server navigate to the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payglongform}] "
"tab to view and manage {payg} credentials.  Localhost should provide the "
"description ``{productname} {payglongform}`` and the status should read "
"``Credentials successfully updated``."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard > {payglongform}] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {payg}. Localhost ຄວນຈະສະແດງຄຳອະທິບາຍວ່າ ``{productname} {payglongform}`` ແລະ ສະຖານະຄວນຈະເປັນ ``Credentials successfully updated``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"{productname} offers support for {rhel} clients; however it is important to "
"note that content still needs to be added manually and is not available "
"through the cloud-based RMT service."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel}; ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນສຳຄັນທີ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍເຫດໄວ້ວ່າ ເນື້ອຫາຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການຜ່ານບໍລິການ RMT ເທິງຄລາວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview-redhat.adoc[Red Hat Client "
"Registration]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview-redhat.adoc[Red Hat Client Registration]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ {payg}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Onboarded {byos} Instances without {scc} Credentials"
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Valid {scclongform} credentials are needed to manage {byoslongform} ({byos}) "
"instances of {suse} products in {productname} {payg}.  This applies to all "
"{suse} products except {productname} Proxy {byos}.  Without any {scc} "
"credentials, {productname} {payg} will not allow onboarding any of the "
"mentioned {byos} instances.  The user will get an error."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scclongform} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byoslongform} ({byos}) ຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໃນ {productname} {payg}. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບທຸກໆຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງ {suse} ຍົກເວັ້ນ {productname} Proxy {byos}. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ {scc}, {productname} {payg} ຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ກ່າວມາ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There is a possibility that the user has valid {scc} credentials set with "
"already synced-up channels and the {byos} onboarded, but at some point "
"decides to delete those credentials."
msgstr "ມັນອາດເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນ {scc} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ ລວມທັງໄດ້ເພີ່ມ {byos} ເຂົ້າໄປແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງພັດຕັດສິນໃຈລົບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the scenario of having already onboarded {byos} instances but no {scc} "
"credentials set, the following restrictions apply:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປແລ້ວ ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ {scc}, ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"A warning message will be shown to the user to let them know that they will "
"not be able to manage those instances."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຊາບວ່າ ເຂົາເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງ instance ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Non-compliant {byos} instances will not be able to be managed neither "
"through {salt} or Salt-SSH.  This applies to individual server management, "
"SSM and action-chains.  When dealing with several servers at once, as long "
"as there is one non-compliant {byos} instance among them, the entire "
"action/action-chain will be aborted for all servers."
msgstr "{byos} instance ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງໄດ້ ທັງຜ່ານ {salt} ຫຼື Salt-SSH. ອັນນີ້ລວມເຖິງການຄຸ້ມຄອງເຊີເວີແບບດ່ຽວ, SSM ແລະ action-chains. ເມື່ອຈັດການກັບເຊີເວີຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນ, ຫາກມີ {byos} instance ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ້ແຕ່ເຄື່ອງດຽວ, ການດຳເນີນການ/action-chain ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Non-compliant {byos} instances will not be able to access any repository "
"hosted in {productname} {payg} as long as {scc} credentials are not set.  "
"{productname} {payg} will return ``HTTP 401 Unauthorized`` until the "
"situation is amended, that is trying to install or upgrade packages using "
"zypper from those machines directly will not work."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (Repository) ໃດໆທີ່ໂຮສຢູ່ໃນ {productname} {payg} ຕາບໃດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc}. {productname} {payg} ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ``HTTP 401 Unauthorized`` ຈົນກວ່າສະຖານະການຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂ, ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ zypper ຈາກເຄື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍກົງຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງ {payg}"

#. :keywords: Payg, Pay-as-you-go, AWS, Amazon Web Services, Azure, GCP, Google Cloud Compute,  cost-effective, scaling, Cloud Services, {productname}, Monitoring
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{payg} does not require a long-term subscription.  Users can leverage the "
"images of {productname} on a {payglongform} basis, paying only for the time "
"of use, and the number of managed and monitored systems.  {payg} with "
"{productname} is an optimal solution for those seeking control, convenience, "
"and cost savings when managing and monitoring their infrastructure on AWS, "
"Azure, and GCP."
msgstr "{payg} ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ແບບໄລຍະຍາວ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ Image ຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ {payglongform}, ໂດຍຈ່າຍຕາມເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ ແລະ ຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມ. {payg} ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} ເປັນ Solution ທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຄວບຄຸມ, ຄວາມສະດວກ ແລະ ການປະຢັດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການຈັດການ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກເຂົາໃນ AWS, Azure, ແລະ GCP."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to {payg}"
msgstr "ແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} {payg} or {payglongform} is a flexible and cost-effective "
"solution that allows users to manage and monitor their systems from several "
"cloud services.  {payg} does not require a long-term subscription through "
"the {scclongform}.  Users can leverage images of {productname} on a "
"{payglongform} basis, paying only for the time of use, and the number of "
"**managed** and **monitored** systems."
msgstr "{productname} {payg} ຫຼື {payglongform} ແມ່ນໂຊລູຊັນທີ່ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄ່າ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຈັດການ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມລະບົບຂອງພວກເຂົາຈາກບໍລິການຄລາວຕ່າງໆ. {payg} ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄລຍະຍາວຜ່ານ {scclongform}. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ອິມເມຈຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ {payglongform}, ໂດຍຈ່າຍເງິນສະເພາະເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ ແລະ ຕາມຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກ **ຈັດການ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມ**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{payg} with {productname} is an optimal solution for those seeking control, "
"convenience, and cost savings when managing and monitoring their "
"infrastructure on {awslongform}, {azure}, and {gcplongform}."
msgstr "{payg} ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} ເປັນ Solution ທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຄວບຄຸມ, ຄວາມສະດວກ ແລະ ການປະຢັດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການຈັດການ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກເຂົາໃນ {awslongform}, {azure}, ແລະ {gcplongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For customers running 10 or more {payg} SLES for SAP Applications instances "
"who also wish to access the {productname} {byos} Lifecycle subscription, an "
"email must be sent to susemanagerkey@suse.com.  The email should include "
"proof of at least 10 active SLES for SAP {payg} instances, such as a "
"screenshot of the relevant section of their cloud console.  The subscription "
"key is valid for one year and can be renewed by providing updated proof of "
"the instances at the end of the subscription period."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ງານອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SLES for SAP Applications ແບບ {payg} ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 10 ເຄື່ອງຂຶ້ນໄປ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} {byos} Lifecycle, ຕ້ອງສົ່ງອີເມວໄປທີ່ susemanagerkey@suse.com. ອີເມວຄວນລວມເອົາຫຼັກຖານການໃຊ້ງານອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SLES for SAP {payg} ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 10 ເຄື່ອງ ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ: ຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍ (screenshot) ຂອງສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໃນຄອນໂຊນຄລາວ (cloud console) ຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ຄີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription key) ຈະມີອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານໜຶ່ງປີ ແລະ ສາມາດຕໍ່ອາຍຸໄດ້ໂດຍການສົ່ງຫຼັກຖານການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດໄລຍະເວລາການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benefits of Using {payg}"
msgstr "ປະໂຫຍດຂອງການໃຊ້ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} instance offers a flexible solution tailored to the "
"modern business landscape.  Key benefits include:"
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃຫ້ໂຊລູຊັນທີ່ຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ ເຊິ່ງອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຮູບແບບທຸລະກິດສະໄໝໃໝ່. ປະໂຫຍດຫຼັກໆ ລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Cost Efficiency:* Pay only for what you use, aligning costs with the actual "
"system management needs.\n"
msgstr "*ຄວາມຄຸ້ມຄ່າດ້ານຕົ້ນທຶນ:* ຈ່າຍສະເພາະສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການຈັດການລະບົບຕົວຈິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*No Subscription Required:* Eliminate the need for ongoing commitments or "
"long-term subscriptions, allowing for budget flexibility.\n"
msgstr "*ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້:* ຕັດຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການຜູກມັດຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ຫຼື ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄລຍະຍາວ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ງົບປະມານມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Ease of Use:* Utilize {productname}'s powerful features on a **{payg}** or "
"**{payglongform}** basis, streamlining initial setup and ongoing systems "
"management.\n"
msgstr "*ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍ:* ນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ **{payg}** ຫຼື **{payglongform}**, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຈັດການລະບົບຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເປັນໄປຢ່າງສະດວກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Scalability:* Easily scale the number of systems managed according to your "
"requirements, without worrying about subscription limitations.\n"
msgstr "*ການຂະຫຍາຍຕົວ:* ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຄຸ້ມຄອງໄດ້ງ່າຍຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນເລື່ອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Rapid Deployment:* Quickly run the image of your choice and begin managing "
"your systems, enhancing responsiveness to your needs.\n"
msgstr "*ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ວ່ອງໄວ:* ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຮູບພາບທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທັນທີ, ເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Integration with Cloud Services:* Leverage {productname} {payg} on {aws}, "
"{azure}, or {gcp} taking advantage of cloud infrastructure for an agile "
"systems management experience.\n"
