#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {payglongform} Behind Proxy"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ {payglongform} ຜ່ານ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To identify if a machine is {payg} or not, {productname} needs to use "
"[literal]``sudo`` to run [literal]``instance-flavor-check``tool."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າເຄື່ອງນັ້ນແມ່ນ {payg} ຫຼື ບໍ່, {productname} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [literal]``sudo`` ເພື່ອລັນເຄື່ອງມື [literal]``instance-flavor-check``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the customer is using a http proxy, they need to make sure this setting "
"is correctly managed by [literal]``sudo``, because by default most "
"environment variables are disregarded."
msgstr "ຫາກລູກຄ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ http proxy, ພວກເຂົາຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍ [literal]``sudo``, ເພາະວ່າໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment variables) ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:4
msgid ""
"One way to do it, is to add a file [path]``/etc/sudoers.d/keep_proxy.conf`` "
"with the following content:"
msgstr "ວິທີໜຶ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຄືການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/sudoers.d/keep_proxy.conf`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Preserve any possible proxy configuration\n"
"Defaults env_keep += \"http_proxy https_proxy no_proxy\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# Preserve any possible proxy configuration\n"
"Defaults env_keep += \"http_proxy https_proxy no_proxy\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This ensures the proxy related environment variables are preserved during "
"the privileges escalation."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ proxy ຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍົກລະດັບສິດ (privileges escalation)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Public Cloud"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄລາວສາທາລະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section is dedicated to some common problems you might encounter with "
"{productname} in Public Cloud, and solutions to resolving them."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບກັບ {productname} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ ແລະ ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc:4
