#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Checks"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ {payg}"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking the credentials"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the script fails to collect the credentials, it should provide a proper "
"error message in the logs and in the {webui}."
msgstr "ຫາກ script ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ, ມັນຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນ logs ແລະ ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If the credentials are not working, [literal]``reposync`` should show the "
"proper error."
msgstr "ຫາກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້, [literal]``reposync`` ຄວນສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using [literal]``registercloudguest``"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ [literal]``registercloudguest``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Refreshing or changing the [literal]``registercloudguest`` connection to the "
"public cloud update infrastructure should not interfere with the credentials "
"usage."
msgstr "ການຣີເຟຣຊ ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [literal]``registercloudguest`` ກັບໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຂອງພັບບລິກຄລາວ ບໍ່ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Running [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` will cause problems if no "
"new cloud connection is registered with the cloud guest command."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄລາວໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ cloud guest."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with Separate Disk for {byos}"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "ບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} setup results with an error while restarting services during "
"setup.  The setup fails on restarting [literal]``tomcat``."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການໃໝ່. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງ Restart [literal]``tomcat``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-error-1.png"
msgstr "tshoot-error-1.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When {productname} is set up using separate disks for cache, {postgresql} "
"and spacewalk, the existing data within these partitions are covered under "
"the new mount point."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ດິດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ cache, {postgresql} ແລະ spacewalk, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ພາຍໃນພາກສ່ວນ (partitions) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກກວມເອົາພາຍໃຕ້ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount point) ໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-partitions.png"
msgstr "tshoot-partitions.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Because of this, data for certain services like tomcat go missing due to a "
"broken symbolic link."
msgstr "ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບບາງບໍລິການເຊັ່ນ tomcat ຈຶ່ງຫາຍໄປເນື່ອງຈາກລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link) ຂາດ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"
msgstr "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:10
msgid ""
"As {productname} instance of cloud already has some services set up, when "
"the data is not available during set up it causes the service to not restart "
"as expected.  Therefore the setup fails."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ instance ຂອງ {productname} ເທິງ cloud ມີບາງບໍລິການທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຶ່ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-incomplete-files.png"
msgstr "tshoot-incomplete-files.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:12
