#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-actual-files.png"
msgstr "tshoot-actual-files.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to Recreate"
msgstr "ວິທີສ້າງບັນຫາຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recreating the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງບັນຫາຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} Server provisioned in {aws} uses relevant AMI for {byos}"
msgstr "{productname} Server ທີ່ຖືກຈັດກຽມໃນ {aws} ໂດຍໃຊ້ AMI ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Separate storage for spacewalk, {postgresql} and cache.  The size of the "
"partition depends on the repository to be synchronized."
msgstr "ແຍກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ spacewalk, {postgresql} ແລະ cache. ຂະໜາດຂອງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ repository ທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:18
msgid "Set up {productname} using [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To resolve or avoid the issue, copy the data of the underlying partition "
"into the new partition by following the steps below:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພາກສ່ວນເດີມລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນໃໝ່ໂດຍປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:22
msgid "Create a backup partition"
msgstr "ສ້າງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) ສຳຮອງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /bkp\n"
msgstr "mkdir /bkp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:24
msgid "Unmount the affected partition for example /var/cache."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Unmount) ພາກສ່ວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ເຊັ່ນ /var/cache."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "umount /var/cache\n"
msgstr "umount /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Check the underlying data in the partition.  This should list the actual "
"data present in the directory."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານໃນພາກສ່ວນດັ່ງກ່າວ. ເຊິ່ງຄວນຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:28
msgid "Copy the data onto the backup partition created in step 1."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນສຳຮອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:30
msgid "Mount the partition again using option 1 or 2:"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Mount) ພາກສ່ວນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ 1 ຫຼື 2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(option 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(option 2)   mount -a (if you have the entries under /etc/fstab)\n"
msgstr ""
"(ທາງເລືອກ 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(ທາງເລືອກ 2)   mount -a (ຖ້າທ່ານມີລາຍການຢູ່ໃນ /etc/fstab)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:32
msgid "Copy the backed up data from step 4 to the mounted partition"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 4 ໄປຍັງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:34
msgid "Verify the data is present"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:36
msgid "Repeat the {productname} setup"
msgstr "ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When using {productname} in public cloud with separate data partitions, make "
"sure that the existing data in those directories are copied onto the new "
"partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ public cloud ທີ່ມີການແຍກພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກຄັດລອກລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນໃໝ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses formulas with forms to configure your SAP clients.  There "
"are two formulas that you need to use:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ສູດ (formulas) ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ SAP ຂອງທ່ານ. ມີສອງສູດທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:3
msgid "``Hana`` to configure the HANA database"
msgstr "``Hana`` ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:4
msgid "``Cluster`` to configure the clients into a cluster"
msgstr "``Cluster`` ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ເປັນຄລັສເຕີ (cluster)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The formulas are provided by packages that you can download with your "
"package manager.  You need to install the formulas on the {productname} "
"Server.  When you have installed the package, you can use the {productname} "
"{webui} to enable and configure the formulas.  As you go through the formula "
"configuration process, provide details of the clients that contain your SAP "
"cluster, to set them up appropriately."
msgstr "ສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນມາພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດໄດ້. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To install the formulas on the {productname} Server, use your package "
"manager to install these packages:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງສູດຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:7
msgid "``saphanabootstrap-formula``"
msgstr "``saphanabootstrap-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:8
msgid "``sapnwbootstrap-formula``"
msgstr "``sapnwbootstrap-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:9
msgid "``drbd-formula``"
msgstr "``drbd-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:10
msgid "``habootstrap-formula``"
msgstr "``habootstrap-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:11
msgid "``salt-shaptools``"
msgstr "``salt-shaptools``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The order that you enable and configure the formulas is important.  You must "
"enable, configure, and apply the HANA formula first.  Then you can enable, "
"configure, and apply the cluster formula.  If you perform these steps in the "
"wrong order, your SAP installation fails."
msgstr "ລຳດັບໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດແມ່ນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ສູດ HANA ກ່ອນ. ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ສູດ cluster ໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຜິດລຳດັບ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ຂອງທ່ານຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the HANA Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"click the client to use as the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ຄລິກເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼັກ (primary) ໃນຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, locate the ``Sap Hana "
"Deployment`` heading, and check the ``Saphanabootstrap`` formula in the "
"list.  Click btn:[Save] and apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ ``Sap Hana Deployment``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກສູດ ``Saphanabootstrap`` ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ (apply) highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສູດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Hana] tab, and "
"complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສູດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Formulas[Hana], ແລະ ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດໃນແບບຟອມໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Make sure you check [guimenu]``Install required packages`` to install "
"everything you need on the client.  In the [guimenu]``Nodes`` sections, type "
"the short hostname of the client to install the HANA database or the "
"hostname you can retrieve on the command line with:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Install required packages`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Nodes``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ hostname ແບບສັ້ນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA ຫຼື hostname ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຜ່ານ command line ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"
msgstr "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:19
msgid "Provide further details for the installation."
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate.  When the highstate is complete, you "
"can go on to apply the cluster formula."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກ btn:[Save], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate. ເມື່ອ highstate ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ສູດ cluster ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_hana_formula.png"
msgstr "suma_sap_hana_formula.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the Cluster Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Cluster"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, locate the ``Cluster`` heading, "
"and check the ``Habootstrap`` formula in the list.  Click btn:[Save] and "
"apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ ``Cluster``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກສູດ ``Habootstrap`` ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສູດ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_formulas.png"
msgstr "suma_sap_formulas.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Cluster] tab, "
"and complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສູດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Formulas[Cluster], ແລະ ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດໃນແບບຟອມໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Make sure you check [guimenu]``Install required packages`` to install "
"everything you need on the client.  Give your cluster a name, and specify "
"the hostname of the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Install required packages`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ຄລັສເຕີຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ລະບຸ hostname ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼັກໃນຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກ btn:[Save], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_cluster_formula.png"
msgstr "suma_sap_cluster_formula.png"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick Start: SAP Overview"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ່ວນ: ພາບລວມ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to use {productname} to install and configure "
"an SAP cluster.  It guides you through setting up a single {productname} "
"Server, preparing your client systems, and configuring the cluster using "
"formulas."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວິທີການໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SAP cluster. ມັນຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ດ່ຽວ, ການກຽມລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄລັສເຕີໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about SAP, see the SAP documentation at "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ SAP, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ SAP ຢູ່ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about {productname}, see the {productname} "
"documentation at https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {productname}, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ {productname} ຢູ່ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/suma."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing Clients"
msgstr "ການກຽມລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your SAP cluster requires several client systems.  Prepare your clients on "
"physical or virtual hardware, and ensure you have {sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP "
"installation media ready.  You cannot create an SAP cluster without the "
"{sles} SAP extension, as it provides tooling specific to SAP."
msgstr "SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ. ໃຫ້ກຽມລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໃນ ຮາດແວຈິງ ຫຼື ຮາດແວສະເືອນ, ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 ສຳລັບ SAP ພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ SAP cluster ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ {sles} SAP, ເພາະມັນມີເຄື່ອງມືສະເພາະສຳລັບ SAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"One of the key features of SAP is high availability of the cluster.  Every "
"component within an SAP cluster has redundancy and failover protection.  "
"When you are preparing your clients, ensure you have enough hardware and "
"infrastructure to allow for this.  For more information about hardware "
"requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"
msgstr "ໜຶ່ງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກຂອງ SAP ແມ່ນຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສູງ (high availability) ຂອງຄລັສເຕີ. ທຸກໆສ່ວນປະກອບພາຍໃນ SAP cluster ຈະມີການສຳຮອງ ແລະ ລະບົບປ້ອງກັນການຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ (failover). ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຽມລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີຮາດແວ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຮາດແວ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the clients you need to set up for an SAP "
"cluster, see https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ SAP cluster, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the {scclongform}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each client within your SAP cluster must be registered with the "
"{scclongform}.  To obtain your registration code, navigate to "
"https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser.  Log in to your {scc} "
"account, or follow the prompts to create a new account.  Click the "
"btn:[Subscriptions] tab to see the registration code.  When you install "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP the {unifiedinstaller} prompts you for the code."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນ SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}. ເພື່ອຂໍລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່. ຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Subscriptions] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 ສຳລັບ SAP, ລະບົບ {unifiedinstaller} ຈະຖາມຫາລະຫັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about registering {productname} with {scclongform}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} ກັບ {scclongform}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the Clients for Clustering"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບການເຮັດ Clustering"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Every client system must have all the other client systems listed in their "
"[path]``/etc/hosts`` file.  Open the [path]``/etc/hosts`` file on each "
"client, and add the hostname for each of the other clients."
msgstr "ທຸກໆລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/hosts``. ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ hostname ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍເຄື່ອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Shared Storage Device"
msgstr "ສ້າງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Each of the clients needs to be able to access a shared disk.  The shared "
"disk can be physical hardware connected by ethernet, or you can set up a "
"virtual disk and access it with iSCSI."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງດິສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້. ດິສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນສາມາດເປັນຮາດແວຈິງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ ethernet, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ virtual disk ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນດ້ວຍ iSCSI ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you use a virtual disk, consider hosting it on a separate system.  Do not "
"use a client machine to host the shared storage disk."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ virtual disk, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໂຮສ (host) ມັນໄວ້ໃນລະບົບທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ຢ່ານຳໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອໂຮສດິສ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the SAP Installation Software"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດຊອບແວການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Download the SAP installation media and save a copy on each client.  The "
"software that you require differs depending on your environment.  For "
"example, if you are using HANA, you need the SAP HANA platform.  If you are "
"using Netweaver, you need different packages.  These software packages are "
"provided by SAP, not by {suse}."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ. ຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ HANA, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ SAP HANA platform. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ Netweaver, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງການແພັກເກັດອື່ນ. ແພັກເກັດຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ SAP, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure you have saved the installation software in the same file system "
"location on each client.  Alternatively, save it to a shared NFS drive."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ບັນທຶກຊອບແວການຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ NFS ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients to Use Latest ``module.run``"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``module.run`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Each client needs to be configured to use the latest version of "
"``module.run``.  On each of the client machines, open the "
"``/etc/salt/minion`` configuration file and add or edit this line:"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``module.run`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``/etc/salt/minion`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"
msgstr ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:19
msgid "Restart the ``salt-minion`` process to enable the changes:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ (restart) ໂປຣເຊສ ``salt-minion`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Additional Disks for HANA"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງດິສ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For the clients that are going to run the HANA database, you require an "
"additional storage device.  This device is used to store files required by "
"HANA, which are located in the [path]``/hana/`` directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ອຸປະກອນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ HANA ຕ້ອງການ, ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/hana/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:23
msgid ""
"We recommend that this storage device be at least 20{nbsp}GB.  For some "
"installations, you might require more, and it is possible to use multiple "
"disks to provide this storage.  For comprehensive hardware requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 20{nbsp}GB. ສຳລັບບາງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ດິສ໌ຫຼາຍໜ່ວຍເພື່ອເຮັດເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຮາດແວທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the Server"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:25
msgid ""
"First of all, make sure you have an activation key that is associated with "
"the ``SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15`` base channel.  For more information about "
"activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (base channel) ``SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping].  Fill "
"in the appropriate details, and make sure you check the [guimenu]``Manage "
"System Completely via SSH`` checkbox.  In the [guimenu]``Activation Key`` "
"field, select the SLES for SAP activation key."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Bootstrapping]. ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Manage System Completely via SSH``. ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Activation Key``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ activation key ຂອງ SLES for SAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about registering, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Server"
msgstr "ການກຽມເຊີເວີ"

#.  This section needs cleanup for containers!!!
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you start you need to deploy the {productname} Server.  The method "
"for deploying the {productname} Server varies depending on your hardware and "
"environment."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ (deploy) {productname} Server. ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຮາດແວ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} is deployed using the `mgradm` command.  During the deployment "
"process, when you are prompted for which product to install, select "
"{productname} Server.  For more information about deploying the "
"{productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm`. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເມື່ອທ່ານຖືກຖາມວ່າຈະຕິດຕັ້ງຜະລິດຕະພັນໃດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {productname} Server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You need to do some configuration to set up the {productname} {webui}.  In "
"your browser, navigate to the URL of the server, and configure your "
"administration access to the {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}. ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບຈັດການ (administration) ຂອງ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Now you can use the {webui} to prepare software channels and activation keys "
"for your clients."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ເພື່ອກຽມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channels) ແລະ activation keys ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, add the appropriate SAP channels: From the "
"{webui}, add [systemitem]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP``."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ SAP ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ: ຈາກ {webui}, ເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {productname} Server with the {scclongform}.  You can do "
"this using the {webui}.  Add the new channel to your activation key."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ {productname} Server ກັບ {scclongform}. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ {webui}. ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນ activation key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To check if a channel has finished synchronizing navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab.  This "
"dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງຊິງຄ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລະ ເລືອກແຖບ [guimenu]``Products``. ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະຄວາມສຳເລັດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກມັນກຳລັງຖືກຊິງຄ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Software channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization "
"can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເຖິງຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the "
"channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original "
"synchronization data."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຊິງຄ໌ຄັ້ງທຳອິດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໂຄນ (clone) ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄວ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງຂອງການຊິງຄ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt commands have three main components: target, function, and arguments.  "
"The calls are constructed in this format:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ມີສາມສ່ວນປະກອບຫຼັກຄື: target (ເປົ້າໝາຍ), function (ຟັງຊັນ), ແລະ arguments (ອາກິວເມນ). ຮູບແບບການຮຽກໃຊ້ແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"
msgstr "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The target defines the client, or group of clients, on which to run the "
"function."
msgstr "Target ແມ່ນການກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:5
msgid "The function is the particular task to be run."
msgstr "Function ແມ່ນວຽກງານສະເພາະທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:6
msgid "Arguments provide any extra data required by the function."
msgstr "Arguments ແມ່ນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຟັງຊັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Targets"
msgstr "Salt Targets (ເປົ້າໝາຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Salt command targets allow you to specify a client or group of clients.  "
"There are several different targets you can use."
msgstr "Target ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ມີ target ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:10
msgid "List available grains on all clients:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການ grains ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' grains.ls\n"
msgstr "salt '*' grains.ls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:12
msgid "Target a specific client:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍສະເພາະເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Glob Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Glob (ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕົວແທນ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:15
msgid "Target all clients using a particular domain:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດເມນໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:17
msgid "Target all clients using a particular label:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "List Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບລາຍການ (List)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:20
msgid "Specify a flat list of clients, using their IDs:"
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍການລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ ID ຂອງພວກເຂົາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regular Expression Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Regular Expression"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:23
msgid "You can also define targets with PCRE-compliant regular expressions:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍ PCRE-compliant regular expressions ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "IP Address Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍ IP Address"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:26
msgid "List available client IP addresses:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການ IP address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"
msgstr "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:28
msgid "Target a specific client IP address:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ IP address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍສະເພາະເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:30
msgid "Target all clients on a subnet:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໃນ subnet ໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"

#
#. This is general Linux info, not specific to the topic.
#. You can use the [command]``ip`` command to find the subnet mask in the format of ``192.168.1.1/24``:
#. ----
#. ip -o -f inet addr show | awk '/scope global/ {print $4}'
#. ----
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more on targeting, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Execution Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການປະຕິບັດງານ (Execution Modules) ຂອງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:34
msgid ""
"When you have specified a target, provide the module and function to execute "
"on the target."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໂມດູນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກັບເປົ້າໝາຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:35
msgid "Find which modules can be executed on the target:"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາວ່າໂມດູນໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການກັບເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' sys.doc\n"
msgstr "salt '*' sys.doc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For a full list of callable modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Function Arguments"
msgstr "ອາກິວເມນ (Arguments) ຂອງຟັງຊັນ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:39
msgid "Functions accept arguments for any extra data."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສາມາດຮັບອາກິວເມນສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For example, the [command]``pkg.install`` function requires an argument "
"specifying which package to install:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຟັງຊັນ [command]``pkg.install`` ຕ້ອງການອາກິວເມນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"
msgstr "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:42
msgid ""
"You can provide more than one argument to a function, with spaces between "
"them.  For example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອາກິວເມນໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນໄດ້ ໂດຍການເວັ້ນວ່າງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: "
"\"John\"}'\n"
msgstr "salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: \"John\"}'\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Configuration Modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt uses execution and state modules to define, apply, and orchestrate "
"configuration of your devices.  {productname} provides a set of modules "
"called {uyuni} configuration modules, that you can use to configure both "
"{susemgr} and {uyuni} Servers."
msgstr "Salt ໃຊ້ execution ໂມດູນ ແລະ state ໂມດູນ ເພື່ອກຳນົດ, ນຳໃຊ້, ແລະ ຈັດການ (orchestrate) ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ. {productname} ມີຊຸດໂມດູນທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ໂມດູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {uyuni}, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງ {susemgr} ແລະ {uyuni} Servers."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can use the {uyuni} configuration modules directly or using SLS files.  "
"They are especially useful if you have multiple {productname} Servers, for "
"example in Hub installations, but they are also useful for smaller "
"installations."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {uyuni} configuration modules ໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ SLS. ພວກມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກທ່ານມີຫຼາຍ {productname} Servers ເຊັ່ນ ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ Hub, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍຍັງມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about using Hub, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Hub, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:5
msgid "You can use {uyuni} configuration modules to configure:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {uyuni} ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:6
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ (Organizations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:7
msgid "Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Users)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:8
msgid "User permissions"
msgstr "ສິດອະນຸຍາດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:9
msgid "System groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System groups)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:10
msgid "Activation Keys"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt execution modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/modules.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt execution modules, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/modules.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt state modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt state modules, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Configuration Modules"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂມດູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The {uyuni} configuration modules are available in the "
"[package]``uyuni-config-modules`` package.  On the {productname} Server, at "
"the command prompt, as root, use this command:"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {uyuni} ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນແພັກເກັດ [package]``uyuni-config-modules``. ໃນ {productname} Server, ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in uyuni-config-modules\n"
msgstr "zypper in uyuni-config-modules\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This package also installs detailed API descriptions, indications on pillar "
"settings, and examples.  When you have installed the package, navigate to "
"[package]``/usr/share/doc/packages/uyuni-config-modules/``."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດນີ້ຍັງຕິດຕັ້ງຄຳອະທິບາຍ API ຢ່າງລະອຽດ, ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ pillar, ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງຕ່າງໆ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [package]``/usr/share/doc/packages/uyuni-config-modules/``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on the size and spreadness of the environment where {productname} "
"is used some connectivity issues are possible.  There are no common "
"recommendations for all the possible use cases as the environments could be "
"very different expecially if public clouds instances are involved."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ການກະຈາຍຕົວຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ {productname}, ອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບາງຢ່າງ. ບໍ່ມີຄຳແນະນຳທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບທຸກກໍລະນີ ເພາະສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມີການໃຊ້ public cloud instances ມາ涉及."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Minions"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In case clients are losing the connection to the {productname} Server (or "
"{productname} Proxy if involved), they are unreachable from the "
"{productname} Server {webui} or with command line tools.  To understand such "
"a connection issue check if the client is not reachable from the "
"{productname} Server with [command]``salt MINION_ID test.ping``, while "
"[command]``venv-salt-call test.ping`` (or [command]``salt-call test.ping`` "
"if non-bundle {salt} is used on the client) is working fine on the client "
"side.  If this is the case, it is recommended to set "
"[literal]``tcp_keepalive`` parameters."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຄລແອນສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server (ຫຼື {productname} Proxy ຫາກມີ), ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ {productname} Server {webui} ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມື Command line. ເພື່ອທົດສອບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າໄຄລແອນບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``salt MINION_ID test.ping`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [command]``venv-salt-call test.ping`` ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ປົກກະຕິຢູ່ໃນຝັ່ງໄຄລແອນ. ຫາກເປັນເຊັ່ນນີ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາມາມິເຕີ [literal]``tcp_keepalive``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The parameters with the values from the example below can be used as a "
"starting point to look for settings, which could prevent cases of connection "
"loss without restoring for some environments.  It is recommended to put the "
"parameters in the separate drop-in configuration file like "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`` or "
"[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf``, depending on the minion "
"type used on the client side."
msgstr "ພາມາມິເຕີພ້ອມກັບຄ່າຈາກຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເຊິ່ງອາດຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນກໍລະນີການສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກູ້ຄືນໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃສ່ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ເຊັ່ນ [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`` ຫຼື [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf``, ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ Minion ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຝັ່ງໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Keepalive Parameters Example Values"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######      Keepalive settings        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ZeroMQ now includes support for configuring SO_KEEPALIVE if supported by\n"
"# the OS. If connections between the minion and the master pass through\n"
"# a state tracking device such as a firewall or VPN gateway, there is\n"
"# the risk that it could tear down the connection the master and minion\n"
"# without informing either party that their connection has been taken "
"away.\n"
"# Enabling TCP Keepalives prevents this from happening.\n"
msgstr ""
"######      ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Keepalive        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ຕອນນີ້ ZeroMQ ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SO_KEEPALIVE ແລ້ວ ຫາກ OS ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"# ຫາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ minion ແລະ master ຜ່ານອຸປະກອນຕິດຕາມສະຖານະ\n"
"# ເຊັ່ນ firewall ຫຼື VPN gateway, ມັນອາດມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ\n"
"# master ແລະ minion ຈະຖືກຕັດໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ທັງສອງຝ່າຍຊາບ.\n"
"# ການເປີດໃຊ້ TCP Keepalives ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດເຫດການນີ້.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Overall state of TCP Keepalives, enable (1 or True), disable (0 or "
"False)\n"
"# or leave to the OS defaults (-1), on Linux, typically disabled. Default "
"True, enabled.\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# ສະຖານະໂດຍລວມຂອງ TCP Keepalives, ເປີດໃຊ້ (1 ຫຼື True), ປິດໃຊ້ (0 ຫຼື False)\n"
"# ຫຼື ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS (-1), ໃນ Linux ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ True, ເປີດໃຊ້.\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How long before the first keepalive should be sent in seconds. Default "
"300\n"
"# to send the first keepalive after 5 minutes, OS default (-1) is typically "
"7200 seconds\n"
"# on Linux see /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 300\n"
"# ເພື່ອສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກ 5 ນາທີ, ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS (-1) ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 7200 ວິນາທີ\n"
"# ໃນ Linux ເບິ່ງທີ່ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How many lost probes are needed to consider the connection lost. Default "
"-1\n"
"# to use OS defaults, typically 9 on Linux, see "
"/proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຈຳນວນການ probe ທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພື່ອພິຈາລະນາວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 9 ໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງທີ່ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How often, in seconds, to send keepalives after the first one. Default -1 "
"to\n"
"# use OS defaults, typically 75 seconds on Linux, see\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການສົ່ງ keepalive (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ຫຼັງຈາກອັນທຳອິດ. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 75 ວິນາທີໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງທີ່\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxies Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Proxies"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:13
msgid ""
"[command]``salt-broker`` service is used on {productname} Proxies to forward "
"{salt} traffic between the {productname} Server and [command]``salt-minion`` "
"service used on the client side.  It is possible that "
"[command]``salt-broker`` and all the clients behind it could be affected "
"with the same issue as the clients directly connected to the {productname} "
"Server.  The issue could be fixed with the same parameters as recommended "
"for the minions, but specified in [path]``/etc/salt/broker`` on each "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ [command]``salt-broker`` ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxies ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນ {salt} ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ ບໍລິການ [command]``salt-minion`` ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຝັ່ງໄຄລແອນ. ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ [command]``salt-broker`` ແລະ ທຸກໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງມັນ ອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກບັນຫາດຽວກັນກັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server. ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາມາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບ Minions, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/salt/broker`` ໃນແຕ່ລະ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:14
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy connectivity can also suffer when the connectivity to "
"the {productname} Server is lost for a quite long interval.  In such a case "
"Proxy connected clients started to retry the authentication to the "
"[command]``salt-master`` service on the {productname} Server.  This "
"situation could be potentially dangerous because it could lead to collecting "
"large amount of ZeroMQ messages with authentication attemps in the interal "
"buffer of ZeroMQ sockets used inside the [command]``salt-broker`` service.  "
"Then, on restoring the connection to the [command]``salt-master`` all of the "
"pending messages will be pushed to it.  It could lead to the issues on "
"{productname} Server side with [command]``salt-master`` service, because it "
"could be impossible to serve all the cached requests in appropriate time or "
"even to the complete denial of the service."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ອາດຈະມີບັນຫາໄດ້ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server ຂາດຫາຍໄປເປັນເວລາດົນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ໄຄລແອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ Proxy ຈະເລີ່ມພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃໝ່ (Retry authentication) ໄປຫາບໍລິການ [command]``salt-master`` ໃນ {productname} Server. ສະຖານະການນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ ເພາະມັນອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ZeroMQ ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານທີ່ມີຄວາມພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນ Buffer ພາຍໃນຂອງ ZeroMQ sockets ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິການ [command]``salt-broker``. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [command]``salt-master`` ກູ້ຄືນມາໄດ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັນ. ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນຝັ່ງ {productname} Server ກັບບໍລິການ [command]``salt-master`` ເພາະມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ທັງໝົດໃນເວລາທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ຫຼື ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To avoid such situation a set of tuning parameters is available.  As the "
"most important one, [option]``wait_for_backend`` should be set to "
"[literal]``True``.  This prevents opening the sockets for the clients behind "
"the proxy while the connectivity to the [command]``salt-master`` service is "
"not established.  In this case the messages from the clients are not "
"collected in the internal buffers.  ``drop_after_retries`` is setting the "
"number of retries before closing the sockets to drop the cached messages.  "
"The other parameters could help to fine tune the behavior for the "
"environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສະຖານະການດັ່ງກ່າວ, ມີຊຸດຂອງພາມາມິເຕີປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. ທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ [option]``wait_for_backend`` ເຊິ່ງຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ [literal]``True``. ອັນນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນການເປີດ Sockets ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ Proxy ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບບໍລິການ [command]``salt-master`` ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກໄຄລແອນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ Buffer ພາຍໃນ. ``drop_after_retries`` ແມ່ນການກຳນົດຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປິດ Sockets ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້. ພາມາມິເຕີອື່ນໆສາມາດຊ່ວຍປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Setting timeouts, intervals and ``drop_after_retries`` to lower values are "
"making [command]``salt-broker`` service more aggressive on detecting the "
"connection loss to the [command]``salt-master``, so that it puts the clients "
"behind the proxy to the conditions closer as they are connected directly to "
"the {productname} Server.  Increasing the values could provide some benefits "
"in case if the network channel between the {productname} Proxy and "
"{productname} Server is not stable enough, the message buffering can provide "
"some flexibility while re-establishing the connection."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Timeouts, Intervals ແລະ ``drop_after_retries`` ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າຕ່ຳລົງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການ [command]``salt-broker`` ກວດສອບການສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [command]``salt-master`` ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ Proxy ຢູ່ໃນສະພາວະທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server. ການເພີ່ມຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະໃຫ້ປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍສະຖຽນ, ເຊິ່ງການເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໄວ້ໃນ Buffer ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Values for Keepalive Parameters"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   ZeroMQ connection options    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# For more details about the following parameters check ZeroMQ "
"documentation:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# All of these parameters will be set to the backend sockets\n"
"# (from the salt-broker to the salt-master)\n"
msgstr ""
"######   ຕົວເລືອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ZeroMQ    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ ZeroMQ:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີທັງໝົດນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ backend sockets\n"
"# (ຈາກ salt-broker ຫາ salt-master)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# connect_timeout (sets ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets how long to wait before timing-out a connect to the remote socket.\n"
"# 0 could take much time, so it could be better to set to more strict "
"value\n"
"# for particular environment depending on the network conditions.\n"
"# The value equal to 10000 is setting 10 seconds connect timeout.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"
msgstr ""
"# connect_timeout (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds)\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໝົດເວລາ (timeout) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ remote socket.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 0 ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນເກີນໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຄັ່ງຄັດຂຶ້ນ\n"
"# ຕາມສະພາບເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນັ້ນໆ.\n"
"# ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ 10000 ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ timeout 10 ວິນາທີ.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# reconnect_ivl (sets ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 100\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time before reconnection attempt on connection "
"drop.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"
msgstr ""
"# reconnect_ivl (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 100\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# This parameter is important for detection of loosing the connection.\n"
"# In case of value equal to 0 it is not sending heartbits.\n"
"# It's better to set to more relevant value for the particular "
"environment,\n"
"# depending on possible network issues.\n"
"# The value equal to 20000 (20 seconds) works good for most cases.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອການກວດສອບວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"# ຫາກຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0 ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງ heartbeat.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ,\n"
"# ໂດຍພິຈາລະນາຈາກບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 20000 (20 ວິນາທີ) ມັກຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີໃນກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time to consider that the connection is timed out\n"
"# after sending the heartbeat and not getting the response on it.\n"
"# The value equal to 60000 (1 minute) is considering the connection is "
"down\n"
"# after 1 minute of no response to the heartbeat.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ (timeout)\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງ heartbeat ໄປແລ້ວແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 60000 (1 ນາທີ) ໝາຍເຖິງການພິຈາລະນາວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕອບກັບ heartbeat ເປັນເວລາ 1 ນາທີ.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   Other connection options    ######\n"
"# The following parameters are not related to ZeroMQ,\n"
"# but the internal parameters of the salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# default: -1\n"
"# value unit: number of retries\n"
"# Drop the frontend sockets of the salt-broker in case if it reaches\n"
"# the number of retries to reconnect to the backend socket.\n"
"# -1 means not drop the frontend sockets\n"
"# It's better to choose more relevant value for the particular "
"environment.\n"
"# 10 can be a good choise for most of the cases.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"
msgstr ""
"######   ຕົວເລືອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອື່ນໆ    ######\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ ZeroMQ,\n"
"# ແຕ່ເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີພາຍໃນຂອງ salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: -1\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ຈຳນວນການລອງໃໝ່\n"
"# ປິດ frontend sockets ຂອງ salt-broker ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ພະຍາຍາມ\n"
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ backend socket ຄົບຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ກຳນົດແລ້ວ.\n"
"# -1 ໝາຍເຖິງ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງປິດ frontend sockets\n"
"# ຄວນເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 10 ເປັນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# default: False\n"
"# The main aim of this parameter is to prevent  collecting the messages\n"
"# with the open frontend socket and prevent pushing them on connecting\n"
"# the backend socket to prevent large number of messages to be pushed\n"
"# at once to salt-master.\n"
"# It's better to set it to True if there is significant numer of minions\n"
"# behind the salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: False\n"
"# ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ\n"
"# ໃນຂະນະທີ່ frontend socket ເປີດຢູ່ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ\n"
"# ທັນທີທີ່ backend socket ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ\n"
"# ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ salt-master ພ້ອມກັນໃນບາດດຽວ.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ True ຫາກມີ minions ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ\n"
"# ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Salt States"
msgstr "Salt States ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can create your own custom Salt states with {productname} as centrally "
"managed configuration channels.  Custom states are stored as Salt state "
"files on the {productname} Server with a ``.sls`` extension."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ Salt states ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ດ້ວຍ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຄຸ້ມຄອງແບບສູນກາງ. Salt states ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ Salt state ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server ໂດຍມີນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເປັນ ``.sls``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a New Custom Salt Channel"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to create and edit custom Salt state "
"files.  You must create a state channel first, with an initial state named "
"``init.sls``.  The ``init.sls`` file is used to reference all other state "
"files within the channel.  The custom states that you create using the "
"{webui} are stored on the {productname} Server in the "
"[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/`` directory."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ custom Salt state. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ State channel ກ່ອນ ໂດຍມີ State ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຊື່ວ່າ ``init.sls``. ໄຟລ໌ ``init.sls`` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງຫາໄຟລ໌ State ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດພາຍໃນ Channel. Custom states ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ທີ່ Directory [path]``/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:5
msgid ""
"After the channel is created with an ``init.sls`` file, you can write "
"additional state files in the {webui}.  Alternatively, you can upload "
"existing state files to use within your state channel, or import them from "
"other channels or clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ ``init.sls`` ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໄຟລ໌ state ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {webui} ໄດ້. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ state ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ພວກມັນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Salt Channel and Initial State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ State ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:23
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:29
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:52
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create State Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create State Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:9
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type a name for your state."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ state ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a label.  Use alphanumeric characters, "
"hyphens, and underscores.  Do not use spaces."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນປ້າຍຊື່ (label). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກາງ, ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type a short description of the "
"configuration your state performs."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ state ຂອງທ່ານດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, type the contents of your "
"``init.sls`` state.  If you want to reference file templates in this "
"configuration channel, ensure your file starts by specifying the source of "
"the managed file, using this syntax:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SLS Contents``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເນື້ອຫາຂອງ state ``init.sls`` ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ file templates ໃນຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການລະບຸແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ syntax ນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"
msgstr ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"

