"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"
msgstr ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Package Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຄຸ້ມຄອງແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"
msgstr ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Remote Command"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄຳສັ່ງໄລຍະໄກ (Remote Command)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"
msgstr ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Service Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຄຸ້ມຄອງບໍລິການ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"
msgstr ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom State to Trust a GPG Key"
msgstr "State ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:46
msgid ""
"By default, operating systems trust only their own GPG keys when they are "
"installed, and do not trust keys provided by third party packages.  The "
"clients can be successfully bootstrapped without the GPG key being trusted.  "
"However, you cannot install new third party packages or update them until "
"the keys are trusted."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະເຊື່ອຖືສະເພາະ GPG keys ຂອງຕົນເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນເມື່ອຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື keys ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍແພັກເກັດຈາກພາຍນອກ (third party). ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດເຮັດ bootstrapping ໄດ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ກໍໄດ້. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອັບເດດພວກມັນໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າ keys ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Salt clients are set to trust {suse} tools channels GPG keys when they are "
"bootstrapped.  For all other clients and channels, you need to manually "
"trust third party GPG keys."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື {suse} ເມື່ອພວກມັນ ຖືກ bootstrapped. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຈາກພາຍນອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If you are bootstrapping Salt clients from the {productname} {webui}, you "
"can use a custom Salt state to trust the GPG key."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ bootstrapping ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt state ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting a GPG Key With a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key ດ້ວຍ Salt State ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Locate the key that you need to trust.  Ensure you have the correct key, and "
"that you also have the fingerprint used to verify the key.  This information "
"is available from the vendor or, in some cases, from a key server."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ key ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ທ່ານກໍມີ fingerprint ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ key ນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດຫາໄດ້ຈາກ ຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor) ຫຼື ໃນບາງກໍລະນີແມ່ນຈາກ key server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Copy the key to a file location where the client can access it.  We "
"recommend saving it in the [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` directory, where "
"all user public files must be saved."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ Key ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄຄລແອນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ Directory [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ສາທາລະນະທັງໝົດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:54
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type a name for your state.  For example, "
"``GPG Key Trusts``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ state ຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``GPG Key Trusts``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:55
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a label.  For example, "
"``GPG_Key_Trusts``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນປ້າຍຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``GPG_Key_Trusts``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type a short description of the "
"configuration your state performs.  For example, ``Trusts GPG Keys for "
"CentOS``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ state ຂອງທ່ານດຳເນີນການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``Trusts GPG Keys for CentOS``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, create a state to retrieve the "
"appropriate key from the {productname} Server and trust it on the client.  "
"The exact contents of your state varies depending on your client operating "
"system.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SLS Contents``, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ state ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາ key ທີ່ເໝາະສົມຈາກ {productname} Server ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືມັນໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງ state ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"
msgstr ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
msgstr ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Alternatively, you can add GPG keys to a configuration channel, using a "
"managed file to deploy them directly on the client.\n"
"  In this case, you would use a local path to the key, rather than a URL.\n"
msgstr ""
"  ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ GPG keys ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ managed file ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນໂດຍກົງໃນລູກຂ່າຍ.\n"
"  ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງສຳລັບ key, ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ URL.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels] and click the name of the state you "
"want to assign a client to.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ state ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab and check the clients you "
"want to assign.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the configuration file is next run on the client, the GPG key is "
"trusted.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຖືກດຳເນີນການໃນລູກຂ່າຍຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, GPG key ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can manage your GPG keys from your own repository hosted "
"on an external file management system."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງ GPG keys ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ repository ຂອງຕົນເອງ ທີ່ໂຮສ (host) ໄວ້ໃນລະບົບບໍລິຫານຈັດການໄຟລ໌ພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a custom state at highstate"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:68
msgid ""
"To apply a custom state at highstate create a mapping in "
"[path]``/srv/salt/top.sls``.  This short example maps the [literal]``test`` "
"state to the system group [literal]``12``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນຕອນເຮັດ highstate ໃຫ້ສ້າງ mapping ໃນ [path]``/srv/salt/top.sls``. ຕົວຢ່າງສັ້ນໆນີ້ຈະ map state [literal]``test`` ເຂົ້າກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ [literal]``12``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"
msgstr ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt File Locations and Structure"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are several ways to set up the Salt file structure.  This section "
"describes how Salt is supported and set up as part of {productname} Server.  "
"The main configuration file is "
"[path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການຈັດວາງໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Salt. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີທີ່ Salt ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ {productname} Server. ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັກແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Do not edit the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` configuration "
"file.  This file belongs to the [package]``spacewalk-setup`` package and is "
"marked as [literal]``%config``.  When {suse} updates the "
"[package]``spacewalk-setup`` package, the [path]``susemanager.conf`` file is "
"overwritten, and any customization is lost.  Instead, add your own "
"configuration file to the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/`` directory.  This "
"prevents the update process from deleting your settings from the main "
"[path]``susemanager.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr "ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເປັນຂອງແພັກເກັດ [package]``spacewalk-setup`` ແລະ ຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ເປັນ [literal]``%config``. ເມື່ອ {suse} ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດ [package]``spacewalk-setup``, ໄຟລ໌ [path]``susemanager.conf`` ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ, ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງຕ່າງໆຈະສູນຫາຍໄປ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານເອງເຂົ້າໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເດດລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ [path]``susemanager.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Some settings from [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` that can "
"help with finding configuration options:"
msgstr "ບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` ທີ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການຄົ້ນຫາຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different file roots. Custom salt states should only be placed "
"in\n"
"# /srv/salt.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າ file roots ຕ່າງໆ. Salt states ແບບກຳນົດເອງຄວນຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ\n"
"# /srv/salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"# ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຄວນແຕະຕ້ອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different pillar roots. Custom pillar data should only be "
"placed\n"
"# in /srv/pillar.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າ pillar roots ຕ່າງໆ. ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແບບກຳນົດເອງຄວນຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ\n"
"# /srv/pillar ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"# ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຄວນແຕະຕ້ອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When you are working with [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``, be "
"aware that:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຮັດວຽກກັບ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``, ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:8
msgid "Files listed are searched in the order they appear"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນປະກົດຂຶ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:9
msgid "The first matching file found is called"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:10
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt state data from five root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt state ຈາກຫ້າໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ (root directories):"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt``"
msgstr "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This directory is shipped and updated with {productname} and includes "
"certificate setup and common state logic to be applied to packages and "
"channels."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບ {productname} ແລະ ປະກອບມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ແລະ ຕັກກະ state ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:28
msgid "Do not edit or add custom Salt data to this directory."
msgstr "ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states``"
msgstr "[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states``"
msgstr "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:16
msgid ""
"These directories are shipped and updated with {productname} or additional "
"extensions.  They include states for Salt formulas."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບ {productname} ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ພວກມັນປະກອບມີ states ສຳລັບ Salt formulas."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt``"
msgstr "[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This directory is generated by {productname}, based on assigned channels and "
"packages for clients, groups, and organizations.  This directory will be "
"overwritten and regenerated.  It is the Salt equivalent of the {productname} "
"database."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname}, ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ, ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ອົງກອນ. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ສະເໝີ. ມັນປຽບເໝືອນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:21
msgid "Within this directory, each organization has a sub-directory."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້, ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນຈະມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLS File Directory Structure"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂຄງສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄຟລ໌ SLS"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... files needed by states (uploaded by users)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... other SLS files (created by users)...\n"
"For example:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # user created\n"
"│   │    ... other files needed by states ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # user created\n"
"            ... other SLS files ...\n"
msgstr ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ states ຕ້ອງການ (ອັບໂຫຼດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... ໄຟລ໌ SLS ອື່ນໆ (ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້)...\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"│   │    ... ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆທີ່ states ຕ້ອງການ ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"            ... ໄຟລ໌ SLS ອື່ນໆ ...\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/srv/salt``"
msgstr "[path]``/srv/salt``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This directory is used for custom state data, modules, and related data.  "
"{productname} does not operate or use this directory directly.  The state "
"data in this directory is used by the client highstate, and is merged with "
"the total state result generated by {productname}.  Use this directory for "
"custom Salt data."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໂມດູນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ດຳເນີນການ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ state ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ client highstate, ແລະ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ state ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:26
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt pillar data from two root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt pillar ຈາກສອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:27
msgid ""
"/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: This directory is generated by "
"{productname}.  It is shipped and updated together with {productname}."
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname}. ມັນຖືກສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:29
msgid ""
"/srv/pillar:: By default, {productname} does not operate or use this "
"directory directly.  The custom pillar data in this directory is merged with "
"the pillar result created by {productname}.  Use this directory for custom "
"Salt pillar data."
msgstr "/srv/pillar:: ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ດຳເນີນການ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ pillar ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ Salt pillar ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can use the [systemitem]``gitfs`` fileserver backend to serve Salt data "
"from git repositories.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [systemitem]``gitfs`` fileserver backend ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ຈາກ git repositories ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bind Formula"
msgstr "Bind Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Bind formula is used to configure the Domain Name System (DNS) on the "
"branch server.  POS terminals will use the DNS on the branch server for name "
"resolution of {saltboot} specific hostnames."
msgstr "Bind formula ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Domain Name System (DNS) ໃນ branch server. POS terminals ຈະໃຊ້ DNS ໃນ branch server ເພື່ອແປງຊື່ (name resolution) ຂອງ hostname ສະເພາະສຳລັບ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are configuring the Bind formula for a branch server with a "
"dedicated internal network, check that you are using the same fully "
"qualified domain name (FQDN) on both the external and internal branch "
"networks.  If the FQDN does not match on both networks, the branch server "
"will not be recognized as a proxy server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ Bind formula ສຳລັບ branch server ທີ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ໃຊ້ fully qualified domain name (FQDN) ອັນດຽວກັນ ທັງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ ແລະ ພາຍໃນຂອງສາຂາ. ຫາກ FQDN ບໍ່ກົງກັນໃນທັງສອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ, branch server ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນ proxy server."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The following procedure outlines a standard configuration with two zones.  "
"Adjust it to suit your own environment."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານທີ່ມີສອງໂຊນ (zones). ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Zone 1 is a regular domain zone.  Its main purpose is to resolve{saltboot} "
"hostnames such as TFTP, FTP, or Salt.  It can also resolve the terminal "
"names if configured."
msgstr "Zone 1 ແມ່ນ domain zone ປົກກະຕິ. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງຊື່ {saltboot} hostnames ເຊັ່ນ TFTP, FTP ຫຼື Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Zone 2 is the reverse zone of Zone 1.  Its main purpose is to resolve IP "
"addresses back to hostnames.  Zone 2 is primarily needed for the correct "
"determination of the FQDNs of the branch."
msgstr "Zone 2 ແມ່ນ reverse zone ຂອງ Zone 1. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງຄ່າ IP address ກັບຄືນເປັນ hostname. Zone 2 ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການກຳນົດ FQDN ຂອງສາຂາໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#.  REMARK: this procedure is probably too long.  Where to split?
#.  REMARK: are these list items (`*`) substeps?  Or what?  Confusing.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Bind with Two Zones"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Bind ດ້ວຍສອງໂຊນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Check the [systemitem]``Bind`` formula, click [btn]``Save``, and navigate to "
"the menu:Formulas[Bind] tab."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກສູດ [systemitem]``Bind``, ຄລິກ [btn]``Save``, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ເມນູ: Formulas[Bind]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Config`` section, select [systemitem]``Include "
"Forwarders``."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Config``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``Include Forwarders``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Configured Zones`` section, use these parameters for "
"Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Configured Zones``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter the domain name of your branch network "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branch1.example.com``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branch1.example.com``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:12
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Type`` field, select [systemitem]``master``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``master``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Click [btn]``Add item`` to add a second zone, and set these parameters for "
"Zone 2:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ [btn]``Add item`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໂຊນທີສອງ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 2:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, use the reverse zone for the configured IP "
"range (for example: [systemitem]``com.example.branch1``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ reverse zone ສຳລັບຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``com.example.branch1``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:15
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Type`` field, select [systemitem]``master``"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``master``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Available Zones`` section, use these parameters for "
"Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Available Zones``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter the domain name of your branch network "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``File`` field, type the name of your configuration file."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``File``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Start of Authority (SOA)`` section, use these parameters "
"for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Start of Authority (SOA)``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Nameserver (NS)`` field, use the FQDN of the branch server "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Nameserver (NS)``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ FQDN ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Contact`` field, use the email address for the domain "
"administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Contact``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລໂດເມນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:22
msgid "Keep all other fields as their default values."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Records`` section, in subsection [guimenu]``A``, use these "
"parameters to set up an A record for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Records``, ໃນພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``A``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ A record ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Hostname`` field, use the hostname of the branch server "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Hostname``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ hostname ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``IP`` field, use the IP address of the branch server (for "
"example, [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``IP``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ IP address ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Records`` section, subsection [guimenu]``NS``, use these "
"parameters to set up an NS record for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Records``, ພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``NS``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ NS record ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the input box, use the hostname of the branch server (for example: "
"[systemitem]``branchserver``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ hostname ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Records`` section, subsection [guimenu]``CNAME``, use "
"these parameters to set up CNAME records for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Records``, ພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``CNAME``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ CNAME records ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter [systemitem]``tftp``, and in the "
"[guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname of the branch server (for "
"example: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``tftp``, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ hostname ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``ftp``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname "
"of the branch server."
msgstr "ກົດ [guimenu]``Add Item``. ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``ftp``, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ພິມຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``dns``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname "
"of the branch server."
msgstr "ກົດ [guimenu]``Add Item``. ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``dns``, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ພິມຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``dhcp``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname "
"of the branch server."
msgstr "ກົດ [guimenu]``Add Item``. ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``dhcp``, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ພິມຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``salt``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the FQDN of "
"the branch server (for example: "
"[systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "ກົດ [guimenu]``Add Item``. ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``salt``, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ພິມ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Set up Zone 2 using the same parameters as for Zone 1, but ensure you use "
"the reverse details:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Zone 2 ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບ Zone 1, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນແບບປີ້ນກັບ (reverse details):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:35
msgid "The same SOA section as Zone 1."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ SOA ຄືກັນກັບ Zone 1."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:36
msgid "Empty A and CNAME records."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເຣັກຄອດ A ແລະ CNAME ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:37
msgid "Additionally, configure in Zone 2:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ Zone 2:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:38
msgid ""
"`Generate Reverse` field by the network IP address set in branch server "
"network formula (for example, [systemitem]``192.168.1.5/24``)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Generate Reverse` ໂດຍໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``192.168.1.5/24``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:39
msgid ""
"`For Zones` should specify the domain name of your branch network (for "
"example, [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "`For Zones` ຄວນລະບຸຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາຂອງເຈົ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:40
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:25
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:26
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:61
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:83
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:50
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:10
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:32
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:56
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:72
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:97
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:106
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:113
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Save Formula] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:41
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:43
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:26
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:21
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Reverse name resolution on terminals might not work for networks that are "
"inside one of these IPv4 private address ranges:"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຊື່ແບບປີ້ນກັບ (Reverse name resolution) ໃນເທີມິນໍອາດຈະໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ສ່ວນຕົວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:43
msgid "[systemitem]``10.0.0.0/8``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``10.0.0.0/8``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:44
msgid "[systemitem]``172.16.0.0/12``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``172.16.0.0/12``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:45
msgid "[systemitem]``192.168.0.0/16``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``192.168.0.0/16``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:46
msgid ""
"If you encounter this problem, go to the [guimenu]``Options`` section of the "
"Bind formula, and click btn:[Add item]:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Options`` ຂອງສູດ Bind, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Add item]:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:47
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Options`` field, enter [systemitem]``empty-zones-enable``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Options``, ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``empty-zones-enable``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:48
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Value`` field, select [systemitem]``No``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ເລືອກ [systemitem]``No``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Network Formula"
msgstr "ສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ (Branch Network Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Branch Network formula is used to configure the networking services "
"required by the branch server, including DHCP, DNS, TFTP, PXE, and FTP."
msgstr "ສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ລວມທັງ DHCP, DNS, TFTP, PXE, ແລະ FTP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The formula is used only for connecting {productname} Proxy 4.3. with "
"{productname} Server 5.0.  Do not use this formula if you want to connect "
"{productname} Proxy 5.0."
msgstr "Formula ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Proxy 4.3 ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} Server 5.0 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ Formula ນີ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Proxy 5.0."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up a Branch Server Networking"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The branch server can be configured to use networking in many different "
"ways.  The most common ways provide either a dedicated or shared LAN for "
"terminals."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສາຂາສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ. ວິທີທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການສະໜອງ LAN ແບບສະເພາະ ຫຼື ແບບແບ່ງປັນສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up a Branch Server with a Dedicated LAN"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍ LAN ແບບສະເພາະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In this configuration, the branch server requires at least two network "
"interfaces: one acts as a WAN to communicate with the {susemgr} server, and "
"the other one acts as an isolated LAN to communicate with terminals."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ເຊີເວີສາຂາຕ້ອງການອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງອັນ: ອັນໜຶ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ WAN ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {susemgr}, ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ LAN ທີ່ແຍກອອກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This configuration allows for the branch server to provide DHCP, DNS, TFTP, "
"PXE, and FTP services to terminals.  These services can be configured with "
"Salt formulas in the {susemgr} {webui}."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສາຂາສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DHCP, DNS, TFTP, PXE, ແລະ FTP ໃຫ້ແກ່ເທີມິນໍ. ການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍສູດ Salt ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up a Branch Server with a Dedicated LAN"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍ LAN ແບບສະເພາະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:10
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:29
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:40
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In the {susemgr} {webui}, open the details page for the branch server, and "
"navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:30
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Branch Network`` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Branch Network``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:12
msgid "Keep [guimenu]``Dedicated NIC`` checked."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກເອົາ [guimenu]``Dedicated NIC`` ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``NIC`` field, enter the name of the network device that is "
"connected to the internal LAN."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``NIC``, ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ LAN ພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``IP`` field, enter the static IP address to be assigned to "
"the branch server on the internal LAN."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``IP``, ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ static IP ທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບເຊີເວີສາຂາໃນ LAN ພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Netmask`` field, enter the network mask of the internal "
"LAN."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Netmask``, ປ້ອນມາກເຄືອຂ່າຍ (network mask) ຂອງ LAN ພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Check [guimenu]``Enable Route`` if you want the branch server to route "
"traffic from internal LAN to WAN."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກ [guimenu]``Enable Route`` ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສາຂາເຮັດການຫາເສັ້ນທາງ (route) ການສັນຈອນຈາກ LAN ພາຍໃນໄປຫາ WAN."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Check [guimenu]``Enable NAT`` if you want the branch server to convert "
"addresses from internal LAN to WAN."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກ [guimenu]``Enable NAT`` ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສາຂາແປງທີ່ຢູ່ (NAT) ຈາກ LAN ພາຍໃນໄປຫາ WAN."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:18
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:34
msgid "Select the [guimenu]``bind`` DNS forwarder mode."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂໝດ DNS forwarder ແບບ [guimenu]``bind``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:19
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Check DNS forwarder fallback if you want to rely on an external DNS if the "
"branch DNS fails."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກ DNS forwarder fallback ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ DNS ພາຍນອກໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ DNS ຂອງສາຂາເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:36
msgid "Specify the working directory, and the directory owner and group."
msgstr "ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຮັດວຽກ (working directory), ພ້ອມທັງເຈົ້າຂອງ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a Branch Server with a Shared Network"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບແບ່ງປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In this configuration, the branch server has only one network interface "
"card, which is used to connect to the {susemgr} server as well as the "
"terminals."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ເຊີເວີສາຂາມີກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍພຽງອັນດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ {susemgr} ແລະ ເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This configuration allows for the branch server to provide DNS, TFTP, PXE, "
"and FTP services to terminals.  These services can be configured with Salt "
"formulas in the {susemgr} {webui}.  Optionally, the branch server can also "
"provide DHCP services in this configuration."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສາຂາສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DNS, TFTP, PXE, ແລະ FTP ໃຫ້ແກ່ເທີມິນໍ. ການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍສູດ Salt ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເຊີເວີສາຂາຍັງສາມາດສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DHCP ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If DHCP services are not provided by the branch server, ensure that your "
"external DHCP configuration is set correctly:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຊີເວີສາຂາບໍ່ໄດ້ສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DHCP, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ພາຍນອກຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``next-server`` option must point to the branch server for "
"PXE boot to work."
msgstr "ໂຕເລືອກ [systemitem]``next-server`` ຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປທີ່ເຊີເວີສາຂາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການບູດ PXE ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``filename`` option must correctly identify the network boot "
"program (by default, this is [path]``/boot/pxelinux``)."
msgstr "ໂຕເລືອກ [systemitem]``filename`` ຕ້ອງລະບຸໂປຣແກຣມບູດເຄືອຂ່າຍໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ [path]``/boot/pxelinux``)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``domain-name-servers`` option must point to the branch "
"server for correct host name resolution."
msgstr "ໂຕເລືອກ [systemitem]``domain-name-servers`` ຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປທີ່ເຊີເວີສາຂາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂຊື່ໂຮສຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up a Branch Server with a Shared Network"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບແບ່ງປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:31
msgid "Keep [guimenu]``Dedicated NIC`` unchecked."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍຕິກ [guimenu]``Dedicated NIC``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:32
msgid "Enable services on the branch server’s firewall."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການບໍລິການຕ່າງໆໃນໄຟວໍ (firewall) ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:33
msgid "Ensure you include DNS, TFTP, and FTP services."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລວມເອົາການບໍລິການ DNS, TFTP, ແລະ FTP."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Branch Server Terminal Naming"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕັ້ງຊື່ເທີມິນໍຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In this configuration it is required to fill at least [systemitem]``Branch "
"Identification``.  This identifies Branch Server in Retail subsystem and is "
"also used to better organize terminals with their respective branch servers."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ້ອນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [systemitem]``Branch Identification``. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸເຊີເວີສາຂາໃນລະບົບຍ່ອຍ Retail ແລະ ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດການເທີມິນໍກັບເຊີເວີສາຂາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up a Branch Server Identification"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການລະບຸຕົວຕົນເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Terminal Naming`` section, enter the [systemitem]``Branch "
"Identification`` string."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Terminal Naming``, ປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ [systemitem]``Branch Identification``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:42
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to save your changes."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:44
msgid ""
"It is also possible to set various options about terminal naming, for more "
"information about terminal naming see "
"xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກຕ່າງໆ ກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຊື່ເທີມິນໍໄດ້, ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "DHCPd Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ DHCPd"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The DHCPd formula is used to configure the DHCP service on the branch "
"server."
msgstr "ສູດ DHCPd ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການ DHCP ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring DHCP"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {susemgr} {webui}, open the details page for the branch server, and "
"navigate to the Formulas tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ Formulas."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:5
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Dhcpd`` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກສູດ [guimenu]``Dhcpd``, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:6
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Dhcpd] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Dhcpd], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Domain Name`` field, enter the domain name for the branch "
"server (for example: [systemitem]``branch1.example.com``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Domain Name``, ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branch1.example.com``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Domain Name Server`` field, enter either the IP address or "
"resolvable FQDN of the branch DNS server (for example: "
"[systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Domain Name Server``, ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຫຼື FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ DNS ສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Listen Interfaces`` field, enter the name of the network "
"interface used to connect to the local branch network (for example: "
"[systemitem]``eth1``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Listen Interfaces``, ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``eth1``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Network Configuration (subnet)`` section, and use "
"these parameters for Network1:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Network Configuration (subnet)``, ແລະ ໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Network1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Network IP`` field, enter the IP address of the branch "
"server network (for example: [systemitem]``192.168.1.0``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Network IP``, ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.0``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Netmask`` field, enter the network mask of the branch "
"server network (for example: [systemitem]``255.255.255.0``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Netmask``, ປ້ອນມາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``255.255.255.0``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Domain Name`` field, enter the domain name for the branch "
"server network (for example: [guimenu]``branch1.example.com``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Domain Name``, ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [guimenu]``branch1.example.com``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Dynamic IP Range`` section, use these parameters to "
"configure the IP range to be served by the DHCP service:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Dynamic IP Range``, ໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ DHCP:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the first input box, set the lower bound of the IP range (for example: "
"[systemitem]``192.168.1.51``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທຳອິດ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງ IP (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.51``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the second input box, set the upper bound of the IP range (for example: "
"[systemitem]``192.168.1.151``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີສອງ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງ IP (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.151``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Broadcast Address`` field, enter the broadcast IP address "
"for the branch network (for example: [systemitem]``192.168.1.255``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Broadcast Address``, ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ບຣອດແຄສ (broadcast) ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.255``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Routers`` field, enter the IP address to be used by "
"routers in the branch server network (for example: "
"[systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Routers``, ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍຣູດເຕີ (router) ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Next Server`` field, enter the hostname or IP address of "
"the branch server (for example: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Next Server``, ປ້ອນຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filename`` field, if you are booting a client using PXE, "
"type the path to the PXE bootloader."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filename``, ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງບູດໄຄເອັນ (client) ໂດຍໃຊ້ PXE, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາ PXE bootloader."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:21
msgid ""
"There is usually no need to change the default value of "
"[systemitem]``/boot/pxelinux.0``."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ [systemitem]``/boot/pxelinux.0``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filename Efi`` field, if you are booting a UEFI client "
"using PXE, type the path to the PXE bootloader."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filename Efi``, ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງບູດໄຄເອັນ UEFI ໂດຍໃຊ້ PXE, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ PXE bootloader."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:23
msgid ""
"There is usually no need to change the default value of "
"[systemitem]``/boot/shim.efi``."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ [systemitem]``/boot/shim.efi``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filename Http`` field, if you are booting a UEFI client "
"using HTTP, type [systemitem]``http://branchserver/saltboot/boot/shim.efi``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filename Http``, ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງບູດໄຄເອັນ UEFI ໂດຍໃຊ້ HTTP, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``http://branchserver/saltboot/boot/shim.efi``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Synchronization Formula"
msgstr "ສູດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບ (Image Synchronization Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Image Synchronization formula is used to configure when OS images are "
"synchronized to the branch server, and to specify which images to "
"synchronize."
msgstr "ສູດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບ OS ໄປຫາເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບໃດແດ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If this formula is not enabled, synchronization must be started manually, "
"and all images will be synchronized."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ສູດນີ້, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຕ້ອງຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແລະ ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Image Synchronization"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:6
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Image Synchronize`` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກສູດ [guimenu]``Image Synchronize``, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Image Synchronize] tab, and set these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Image Synchronize], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Include Image Synchronization in Highstate`` field to "
"have image synchronization occur every time highstate is applied."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Include Image Synchronization in Highstate`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This ensures that you do not have to perform image synchronization manually, "
"however it requires a high bandwidth environment."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງການສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ສູງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Synchronize only the listed images`` field, click btn:[Add "
"item] to add the images you want to have synchronized automatically."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Synchronize only the listed images``, ກົດ btn:[Add item] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can leave this list blank to have all images "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະລາຍການນີ້ໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The Image Synchronization state does not delete cached images.  If you are "
"running out of disk space, check the size of the Salt client cache "
"directory, and delete it if required.  By default, the directory is located "
"at ``/var/cache/salt/minion``."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບຈະບໍ່ລຶບຮູບພາບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນແຄຊ (cache). ຫາກເນື້ອທີ່ດິດຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງຈະໝົດ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງຂະໜາດຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແຄຊຂອງ Salt client, ແລະ ລຶບມັນອອກຫາກຈຳເປັນ. ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຈະຢູ່ທີ່ ``/var/cache/salt/minion``."

#.  FIXME: where appropriate, use the "Confirm with" expression.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Liberate Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The liberate formula migrates systems from EL clients such as {centos} 7 or "
"{rhel} 9 to {sll}.  With this formula the conversion will take place during "
"the client onboarding on {productname}."
msgstr "Liberate formula ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migrate) ຈາກ EL clients ເຊັ່ນ {centos} 7 ຫຼື {rhel} 9 ໄປຫາ {sll}. ດ້ວຍຟໍມູລານີ້ ການປ່ຽນແປງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (onboarding) ໃນ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:3
msgid "The Liberate Formula comes preinstalled within the server container."
msgstr "Liberate Formula ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າແລ້ວພາຍໃນ server container."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {productname}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To provide all the software channels for {sll} on the {productname} Server, "
"proceed as follows."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສະໜອງຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ຊອບແວທັງໝົດສຳລັບ {sll} ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Providing {scclongform} credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:7
msgid "Sign in to {scclongform} at https://scc.suse.com."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {scclongform} ໄດ້ທີ່ https://scc.suse.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:8
msgid "Navigate to [guimenu]``My Organization``, and select your organization."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``My Organization``, ແລະ ເລືອກອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Users[Organization Credentials] and take note of your "
"organization username and password."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[Organization Credentials] ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງອົງກອນທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Organization Credentials] to add the credentials to your {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຫ້ກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add new credential], and enter the {scclongform} username and "
"password noted in a previous step."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add new credential], ແລະ ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ {scclongform} ທີ່ໄດ້ຈົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing the SLL/SLES-ES channels:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ SLL/SLES-ES:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products]"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:14
msgid "Select the {sll} Channels that you will use:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງ {sll} ທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:15
msgid "EL7 LTSS: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support LTSS 7 x86_64`"
msgstr "EL7 LTSS: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support LTSS 7 x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:16
msgid "EL7: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support 7 x86_64`"
msgstr "EL7: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support 7 x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:17
msgid "EL8: `RHEL or SLES ES or CentOS 8 Base`"
msgstr "EL8: `RHEL or SLES ES or CentOS 8 Base`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:18
msgid "EL9: `RHEL and Liberty 9 Base`"
msgstr "EL9: `RHEL and Liberty 9 Base`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:19
msgid "Click the top right button btn:[Add products]."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Add products] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Initial sychronization can take considerable time. You can check progress by "
"accessing the server machine via SSH and monitoring the logs using:"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັ້ງທຳອິດອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນພໍສົມຄວນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງເຊີເວີຜ່ານ SSH ແລະ ຕິດຕາມລັອກ (logs) ໂດຍໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/*\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/*\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating one Activation Key per {sll} parent channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Activation Key ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງ {sll}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Note: Activation Keys are the way to register systems and automatically "
"assign them to the required software and configuration channels "
"corresponding to them."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: Activation Keys ແມ່ນວິທີການລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ ແລະ ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃຫ້ກັບພວກມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"click the top right button btn:[Create key]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys], ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create key] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:25
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Activation Key`` dialog, set the fields:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Activation Key``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:26
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:27
msgid "Enter some text describing the activation key."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອອະທິບາຍ activation key."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Enter the identifier of the key.  For example [literal``sll9-default`` for "
"EL 9 systems.  Note: Keys will have a numeric prefix depending on the "
"organization, so that they are unique."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຕົວລະບຸຂອງ key. ຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``sll9-default`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ EL 9. ໝາຍເຫດ: Keys ຈະມີຕົວເລກນຳໜ້າຂຶ້ນກັບອົງກອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:31
msgid "Leave blank."
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Base Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:33
msgid "Select one base channel:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໜຶ່ງອັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:34
msgid "EL7 LTSS: `RES-7-LTSS-Updates for x86_64`"
msgstr "EL7 LTSS: `RES-7-LTSS-Updates for x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:35
msgid "EL7: `RHEL x86_64 Server 7`"
msgstr "EL7: `RHEL x86_64 Server 7`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:36
msgid "EL8: `RHEL8-Pool for x86_64`"
msgstr "EL8: `RHEL8-Pool for x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:37
msgid "EL9: `EL9-Pool for x86_64`"
msgstr "EL9: `EL9-Pool for x86_64`"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Child Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (Child Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:39
msgid "Include all child channels."
msgstr "ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add-On system type"
msgstr "ປະເພດລະບົບເສີມ (Add-On system type)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:41
msgid "Leave all blank."
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contact Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:43
msgid "Default"
msgstr "ມາດຕະຖານ (Default)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Universal Default"
msgstr "ມາດຕະຖານທົ່ວໄປ (Universal Default)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:45
msgid "Leave unchecked."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍຕິກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:46
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Liberate formula and assign it to activation keys"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສູດ Liberate ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ activation keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When installed, the formula can be assigned to an Activation Key by creating "
"a System Group:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ສູດສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key ໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System Group):"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning system group and assigning liberate formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບ ແລະ ກຳນົດສູດ liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and "
"click the btn:[Create Group] button in top right corner."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Groups], ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Group] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:51
msgid "In the dialog, fill in the following data:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Name"
msgstr "ຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:53
msgid "liberate"
msgstr "liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:55
msgid "Systems to be converted to SUSE Liberty Linux"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ SUSE Liberty Linux"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:56
msgid ""
"From the `liberate` System Group page, navigate go to the "
"[guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າກຸ່ມລະບົບ `liberate`, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Select the [guimenu]``Liberate`` formula, and click btn:[Save].  A new tab "
"called `Liberate` will appear."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ [guimenu]``Liberate``, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]. ແທັບໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `Liberate` ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:58
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Liberate`` tab, you see the [option]``Reinstall all "
"packages after conversion`` option.  Keep it checked if you want to "
"reinstall all the packages during the migration.  This way you ensure all "
"the packages will have {suse} signatures and no previous package will be "
"kept.  If you do not want to change the state of your system during the "
"migration, uncheck this option and click the btn:[Save Formula] button.  In "
"this case, you can re-install the packages later."
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ [guimenu]``Liberate``, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໂຕເລືອກ [option]``Reinstall all packages after conversion``. ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໄວ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກແພັກເກັດຈະມີລາຍເຊັນຂອງ {suse} ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດເກົ່າຫຼົງເຫຼືອຢູ່. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນສະຖານະຂອງລະບົບໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕິກໂຕເລືອກນີ້ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Save Formula]. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Now a system group exists that has assigned the [guimenu]``Liberate`` "
"formula.  This formula will be applied only once to migrate the system to "
"{sll}, even if you run it multiple times.  With the next procedure, assign "
"the system group to the Activation Key."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ມີກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດສູດ [guimenu]``Liberate`` ແລ້ວ. ສູດນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບໄປເປັນ {sll}, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານຈະສັ່ງໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກໍຕາມ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the system group to the Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:61
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Select the Activation Key, for example [literal]``sll9-default`` for the "
"EL 9 systems."
msgstr "ເລືອກ Activation Key, ຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``sll9-default`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ EL 9."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:63
msgid ""
"From the Activation Key page navigate to the menu:Groups[Join] tab, select "
"the [literal]``liberate`` group, and click the btn:[Join Selected Groups] "
"button.  The group will be assigned to the Activation Key"
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ Activation Key ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Groups[Join], ເລືອກກຸ່ມ [literal]``liberate``, ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Join Selected Groups]. ກຸ່ມດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying migrate directly during registration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ການຍ້າຍລະບົບໂດຍກົງໃນລະຫວ່າງການລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:65
msgid "From the Activation Key page, navigate to the [guimenu]``Details`` tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ Activation Key, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` section, and "
"checkb the [option]``Deploy configuration files to systems on "
"registration``option."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment``, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໂຕເລືອກ [option]``Deploy configuration files to systems on registration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:67
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:68
msgid ""
"When you register a system with this key it will perform the migration "
"automatically."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານລົງທະບຽນລະບົບດ້ວຍ key ນີ້, ມັນຈະເຮັດການຍ້າຍລະບົບໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register a new system and proceed to the migration"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບໃໝ່ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:70
msgid ""
"There are two ways to onboard (or register) a new client with the Activation "
"Key:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ Activation Key:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]"
msgstr "xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:72
msgid "This is intended for a one-off registration or for testing purposes."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງດຽວ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການທົດສອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]"
msgstr "xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:74
msgid "This is intended to be used for mass registration."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "For already registered clients"
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:76
msgid ""
"Software channels, system group membership, and formulas can be assigned to "
"any already registered client.  This method makes use of the bootstrap "
"script mentioned above."
msgstr "Software channels, ສະມາຊິກ system group, ແລະ formulas ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ client ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນນຳໃຊ້ bootstrap script ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Reactivation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Reactivation key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the System Details page of any registered "
"client you want to migrate to {sll}."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເປີດໜ້າ System Details ຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປເປັນ {sll}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Click the [guimenu]`Reactivation` tab.  If there is already a key listed, "
"you can use it.  If not, click btn:[Generate New Key], and copy the entire "
"key.  The key will start with [literal]``re-``."
msgstr "ຄລິກແທັບ [guimenu]`Reactivation`. ຖ້າມີຄີປະກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍການແລ້ວ ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ເລີຍ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Generate New Key], ແລ້ວຄັດລອກຄີທັງໝົດ. ຄີຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [literal]``re-``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:80
msgid ""
"SSH into this client and set the environment variable to be the key that you "
"copied:"
msgstr "SSH ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄຄເອັນນີ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variable) ໃຫ້ເປັນ key ທີ່ທ່ານກັອບປີ້ມາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "export REACTIVATION_KEY=re-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"
msgstr "export REACTIVATION_KEY=re-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Run the bootstrap script from "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[], and the system will "
"re-register using the same profile as before, but with the newly assigned "
"{sll} context."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ bootstrap script ຈາກ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[], ແລະ ລະບົບຈະລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ profile ເດີມ, ແຕ່ຈະມີ context ຂອງ {sll} ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃໝ່."

