#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:49
msgid ""
"By default, the ``salt-minion`` service in ``pxe-yomi-image`` is configured "
"to find the Salt master under the ``salt`` address.  If the DNS server is "
"not able to resolve this address, you need to adjust the ``kernel-options`` "
"parameter from the {cobbler} command that register the distribution, and add "
"a new kernel command line of ``ym.master=master_address``.  This will "
"override the default configuration for the ``salt-minion``."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ໃນ ``pxe-yomi-image`` ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ Salt master ທີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ ``salt``. ຖ້າ DNS server ບໍ່ສາມາດແປຊື່ທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ ``kernel-options`` ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ {cobbler} ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ distribution ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄຳສັ່ງ kernel ໃໝ່ເປັນ ``ym.master=master_address``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະທັບຊ້ອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ ``salt-minion``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Profile in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Profile ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:51
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, define a "
"profile in {cobbler} based on the image."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ profile ໃນ {cobbler} ໂດຍອີງຕາມ image ນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:53
msgid "OPTIONAL: Create a system in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ສ້າງ system ໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If you know the MAC address for the new client to be provisioned, you can "
"have it boot directly from the Yomi image."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ MAC address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ມັນບູດໂດຍກົງຈາກ Yomi image ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the new node has been provisioned, remove the temporary {cobbler} "
"system:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ node ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບ system ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນ {cobbler} ອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"
msgstr "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Salt Pillar Preparation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການກຽມ Salt Pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The parameters of the new installation are defined with a Salt pillar.  The "
"pillar includes parameters that the Yomi state requires during the "
"installation, including the partitions, file systems, repositories, packages "
"installed, and services enabled."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ Salt pillar. Pillar ລວມເອົາພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ Yomi state ຕ້ອງການໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ລວມທັງການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partitions), ລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຄັງຊອບແວ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ບໍລິການທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The pillar is defined using the formulas with forms.  In this example, we "
"prepare the pillar for a minimal openSUSE Tumbleweed installation.  You can "
"find examples for MicroOS or SLES in the example directory "
"[path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."
msgstr "Pillar ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະກຽມ pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Tumbleweed ແບບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ MicroOS ຫຼື SLES ໄດ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີຕົວຢ່າງ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To begin, boot the client that you want to provision using the Yomi PXE boot "
"image, using the {cobbler} procedures described earlier in this section."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ບູດລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi PXE boot image ຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ {cobbler} ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:62
msgid ""
"When the ``salt-minion`` service is running on the new client, accept the "
"key by navigating to menu:Salt[Keys].  When the key is accepted, you can "
"view and manage the client by navigating to menu:Systems[Overview].  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, and add all the Yomi Installer "
"formulas to the client.  When you have added all the formulas, complete the "
"forms and sub-forms.  This section outlines each form and provides example "
"settings for a minimal installation.  For a detailed explanation of every "
"option, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບຄີໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Salt[Keys]. ເມື່ອຄີຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Overview]. ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ Yomi Installer formulas ທັງໝົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ເມື່ອເພີ່ມ formulas ທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນ forms ແລະ sub-forms. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະຫຼຸບແຕ່ລະ form ແລະ ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບພື້ນຖານ. ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:64
msgid ""
"The Yomi form contains some general configuration options.  For example, the "
"keyboard language and layout, the locale information, and the option to "
"perform a full reset of the system after provisioning."
msgstr "Yomi form ປະກອບມີບາງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ. ເຊັ່ນ: ພາສາ ແລະ ຜັງຄີບອດ (keyboard layout), ຂໍ້ມູນ locale, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອຣີເຊັດລະບົບທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:65
msgid "For this example, set the [parameter]``Reboot`` parameter to ``yes``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີ [parameter]``Reboot`` ເປັນ ``yes``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This sub-form provides information about the devices, partitioning, file "
"system (including the BtrFS subvolumes, for example), and LVM and RAID "
"configuration."
msgstr "Sub-form ນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອຸປະກອນ, ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (ລວມທັງ BtrFS subvolumes), ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ LVM ແລະ RAID."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For this example, we assume that the new client has a single device named "
"``/dev/sda``, and that it belongs to a non-UEFI system.  In this case, we "
"have only three partitions: one for the boot loader, one for swap and one "
"for the system.  We also expect to have an ext4 file system for the root "
"directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ມີອຸປະກອນດຽວຊື່ວ່າ ``/dev/sda``, ແລະ ມັນເປັນລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ UEFI. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີພຽງສາມ partitions: ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ boot loader, ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ swap ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລະບົບ. ພວກເຮົາຍັງກຳນົດໃຫ້ມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ext4 ສຳລັບ root directory."

